<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Tue Jan 14 2025 15:53:49 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">Taruuih Liêm Maak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maak</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrk</para>
  <para style="mt">Maak</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Tarnââp Taruuih Liêm ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih Jê-su, Akóón Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Kơi ơi bâân xaraq kalóóng bha-aar Ê-saai manưih đââng taruuih:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Phaai lêi ađô, Aku kayua manưih đââng paraaq ưng Aku vôôiq toom mat Akóón,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">ađó e dhoon kalơng ưng Akóón.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Ve mưi dhariêng dhaloong karơ kalóóng kruung vơng:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Phaai dhoon lơơi kalơng ưng Chuôq;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">têêng đóng tapat nôôq kalơng ưng Ađó.’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Jang ơi tơk têêng bap-teem kalóóng kruung vơng lơq truuih pachóóm pheep bap-teem ưng rau klôôq lóóm leq bâân lơơi matu. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Plok parah Ju-đê lơq dyóp ngaai dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem vôôiq tơk palơq ađó lơq piđó bâân ađó têêng bap-teem dhiq karuung Jô-đen xók đơơp truuih matu lơt ađêi. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Jang nek xơp aau palơq xok kamel palơq xeet xaneet ng'kar praang tarveng ađêi; lơq đah amiit muônh lơq đơơk gayơơiq booiq.<verse eid="MRK 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Ađó truuih pachóóm kơi ađô: “Yaang ve mataai raman lơh aku xók tơk tatun aku; nek Yaang hơq aku kah đaang kóp buôn lêh tarlêi jêi ưng Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Aku têêng bap-teem đóng adhi anó palơq đơơk, bơơi Ađó e têêng bap-teem đóng adhi anó palơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Tarnêêng yuur vaaih kalóóng nôôq tangêi achêk, ađek nek Chuôq Jê-su ơi bhral tââq Na-xa-reet mađó xưưq Ga-li-lê, lơq Ađó bâân Jang têêng bap-teem dhiq karuung Jô-đen. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Lơq n'drươh, xók yuur tââq đơơk, Ađó lêi nôôq talaang pleng bâân talóng lơq Yaang Liêm dhaluônh jaq dhiq Ađó kơi achim paraap. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Lơq mưi dhariêng tơk tââq pleng praaq: “Akóón nek Akóón nh'nhơr ưng Aku. Aku lóng iêm lóóm leq Akóón.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />N'drươh xong ađek, Yaang Liêm chut pađâh Ađó vôôiq leq kruung vơng. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Ađó tơơt kalóóng kruung vơng puôn jêt tangêi, đơơp Sa-taan dharơơl galơơk. Ađó tơơt palơq adhah booiq, lơq nôôq dhơn Pleng têêng yaauq Ađó.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Xong xók Jang bâân takóóp, Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq tơk Ga-li-lê truuih pakah Taruuih Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />lơq praaq kơi ađô: “Tangêi kaxe ơi dyóp, lơq katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng ơi tơk đan. Phaai klôôq lóóm lơq huuiq leq Taruuih Liêm.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Xók vôôiq tring taring tóór taxiiq Ga-li-lê, Ađó lêi Si-môôn lơq En-rê, adhi ưng Si-môôn, xók trah jươl dhiq taxiiq, taai piđó nek manưih bâân kadhóóng. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq nhiđó: “Hêq vôôiq ting thêi, hayơq thêi e têêng adhi anó val xar têi trah jươl manưih.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />N'drươh, xók ơi lơơi jươl lóóiq, nhiđó vôôiq ting Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Xók vôôiq kơơq mưi n'lóóch kalơng dyơq, Ađó lêi Ja-kơ, akóón padruuih Xê-bê-đê, lơq Jang, adhi ưng ađó, nhiđó xók bươl jươl dhiq bhuông. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />N'drươh, xong xók Ađó dhaloong nhiđó, hayơq nhiđó yuur vôôiq ting Ađó, lơơi ama ađêi nek Xê-bê-đê tơơt lóóiq dhiq bhuông nek palơq nôôq manưih têêng makông.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Ađó mót kalóóng kanóón Ka-bê-na-um, lơq n'drươh xók ađek, kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat, xók ơi vôôiq mót đong gươl, Ađó tââp truuih pachóóm. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Palââng kadrêq xâng leq paraaq pachóóm ưng Ađó, taai Ađó ơi pachóóm piđó kơi ve mataai eh rau kơi nôôq thêi pachóóm gani. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />N'drươh xók ađek, mưi manưih bâân yaang môôp bóq biêh xók tơơt kalóóng đong gươl ưng piđó, ađó ađek yuur lalơu, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />kơi ađô: “Jê-su Na-xa-reet ơơi, nôôq yi harau pâng kre tơk Amei? Eh lua Amei bhral buôn leng kaxiêt nôôq yi? Aku n'nal Amei nek ngaai — Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng!” <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Chuôq Jê-su trêh teng abhưi, kơi ađô: “Phaai parngau aq lơq gluh tââq manưih ađô!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Hayơq xong xók yaang môôp dhalươq ađó ađek kalơm, lơq lalơu karơ dhariêng, xong abhưi gluh tââq ađó ađô. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Dyóp ngaai braaih kakhin, patơk mơ tamóh tapraaq palơq xóng piđó kơi ađô: “Chiên ađô nek hau? Mưi paraaq pachóóm tame ting mataai karơ! Tơk mơ ađó achêk trêh đóng yaang môôp lơq piđó xâng bóóp ađó achêk.” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Hayơq taruuih leq Chuôq n'drươh tanđôôr dyóp leq tơk luch parah đan griêq Ga-li-lê.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />N'drươh, xók gluh tââq đong gươl, piđó mót kalóóng đong Si-môôn lơq En-rê, nek palơq Ja-kơ lơq Jang. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Xók achêk, yaya ưng Si-môôn xók ka-ai kahiir bêch dhiq dharââng, lơq piđó đâh praaq palơq Ađó leq amooq. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Bhêêl tơk đan, pei kadhâng têi amooq, Ađó tơq amooq yuur, lơq ka-ai kahiir bil tââq amooq, hayơq amooq tââp têêng yaauq piđó.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Achêk hayơq, tơk habu blót, xong xók mat tangêi ơi xriêp, palââng đââng tơk đóng Ađó pabhơt nôôq ngaai ka-ai karuôq lơq nôôq manưih bâân abhưi bóq. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Tabhơt kanóón ơi karong dhiq nham palóng. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Ađó payươh bơk manưih bâân dhóóng ka-ai palơq dyóp rau ka-ai dreh, lơq viêng bơk abhưi, hơq Ađó kah đóng pheep nôôq abhưi yuur praaq taai piđó n'nal Ađó.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Mót vaar yayóng yayương, bhêêl pleng dyơq lóng kanam, xong xók yuur meh, Ađó gluh leq nguôi, vôôiq tơk mưi dham ranguôq rangóót, lơq dhiq dham ađek, Ađó gavơh nhan. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Si-môôn lơq nôôq manưih tơơt palơq Ađó vôôiq chêk Ađó, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />lơq piđó bâân lêi Ađó, nek móón palơq Ađó kơi ađô: “Dyóp ngaai maar chik-chêk thêi.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Ađó kayua piđó: “Nôôq he phaai vôôiq leq lââng, kalóóng nôôq kanóón praang xirvir, buôn thêi kung truuih pachóóm dhiq ađek dyơq, taai thêi ơi tơk nek taai tarnêêng ađô.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Ađó vôôiq tơk plok luch parah Ga-li-lê, truuih pachóóm kalóóng nôôq đong gươl ưng dhanuôr manưih lơq viêng abhưi.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Xók achêk, mưi chanak ka-ai tơơt bhơơi tơk palơq Ađó, mââl nhan Ađó lơq chakoh takól, móón palơq Ađó, kơi ađô: “La thêi kiêng, thêi ve mataai têêng aku bâân sek.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Lơq taai vaaih lóóm kayô ka-er, xók yuur charó têi ađêi, Chuôq kadhâng leq ađó, lơq praaq palơq ađó: “Aku kiêng. Phaai sek aq.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />N'drươh nek, ka-ai tơơt bhơơi bil tââq ađó lơq ađó bâân sek.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Xong xók praaq parâng pató ađó, Chuôq n'drươh đóng ađó ađek vôôiq. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Chuôq pató ađó ađek: “Phaai chagơn, amei óóq praaq marau marâ palơq dhơ dhangaai, bơơi phaai vôôiq, pakah ađêi palơq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih lơq phaai tapôông nôôq bhanuôih taai tarnêêng bâân sek ưng ađêi, nek tarnêêng hơq Môôi-se ơi truuih pachóóm, kơi mưi paraaq truuih đuui đóng piđó.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xong xók vôôiq lơh, ađó ađek tââp truuih đuui đóng bơk manưih lơq truuih taruuih ađô dyóp leq, tơk mơ Chuôq kah chóóm mót kalóóng mưi kanóón manưih bơk kơi chóóm pakah dyơq, hơq Ađó tơơt hót nguôi dhiq nôôq dham ranguôq rabaang, lơq dhanuôr manưih tââq dyóp dhiq dyơq xók tơk palơq Ađó.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Xók val mót lóóiq kalóóng kanóón Ka-bê-na-um lơh bơơr pe tangêi, dhanuôr manưih bâân xâng kơi Ađó dyơq tơơt dhiq đong. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Lơq bơk manưih ơi karong tơk mơ kah ve dhiq dyơq, patơk mơ dhiq palóng mót gluh kung kah, hayơq Ađó pachóóm paraaq Yaang Pleng đóng piđó. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Masôôq manưih tơk palơq Ađó, đââng ting mưi manưih rabóót dyung têi, bâân glâk tââq puôn nak. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Taai kah chóóm tơk đan Chuôq ơi taai manưih ganơr, piđó n'drơh jarpơơq pađơp nham dhiq Chuôq tơơt, lơq xong xók têêng luôh luông, piđó xua padhaluônh dharââng đu manưih rabóót dyung têi dyơq bêch. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Xók ơi lêi lóóm huuiq ưng piđó, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq manưih rabóót dyung têi: “Akóón ơơi, matu lơt akóón ơi bâân talơơi!” <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Bơơi nôôq thêi pachóóm gani dyơq tơơt dhiq ađek praaq kalóóng lóóm piđó: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Hau manưih ađô vil praaq kơi achêk? Ađó ađô alua chôlô! Ngaai ve mataai lơơi matu chapiên mưi ađó Yaang Pleng?” <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />N'drươh, taai Chuôq Jê-su ơi n'nal kalóóng lóóm yaang ađêi kơi piđó xók tư kanóq dhiq lóóm kơi achêk, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Hau nôôq pe vil kanóq nôôq rau ađek kalóóng lóóm? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Hau rau đu nek khe lơh đóng praaq palơq manưih rabóót dyung têi, ‘Matu lơt amei ơi bâân talơơi!’ môôiq praaq ‘Phaai yuur dyương, hayuur dharââng amei yuur lơq bhadyaang vôôiq!’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Bơơi buôn nôôq pe n'nal kơi Akóón Manưih dhiq katiêk ađô ve mataai lơơi matu”, Ađó praaq palơq manưih rabóót dyung têi: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Aku yua amei phaai yuur dyương, hayuur dharââng ưng amei yuur, lơq chô leq đong ađêi.” <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Kơi achêk nek xong xók yuur dyương hơq n'drươh hayuur dharââng yuur, ađó ađek vôôiq gluh toom mat dyóp ngaai, tơk mơ dyóp ngaai maar chrih lêi lơq bhi haanh Yaang Pleng, móón kơi ađô: “Nôôq he kah glêh mơ lêi tarnêêng kơi achêk.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Ađó vil vôôiq gluh tóór taxiiq, lơq pabhơt tanóói dhanuôr tơk palơq Ađó, hayơq Ađó truuih pachóóm piđó. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Xók bhêêl vôôiq lalơh, Ađó lêi Lê-vi, akóón padruuih ưng A-phê, xók tơơt dhiq đong pagoop jêên, nek Chuôq móón ađó: “Hêq ting thêi!” Xong xók yuur dyương, ađó ting Chuôq.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Tarnêêng yuur vaaih bhêêl Chuôq xók cha vaar dhiq đong ađó, bơk manưih pagoop jêên kung kơi manưih ve matu ting tơơt cha palơq Chuôq Jê-su lơq nôôq môôn-đô Ađó, taai bơk manưih kung ơi ting Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Xók nôôq thêi pachóóm gani mađó kabhuh Pha-ri-si lêi kơi Ađó tơơt cha palơq nôôq manưih ve matu lơq kabhuh pagoop jêên, piđó móón palơq nôôq môôn-đô Ađó: “Hau ađó ađek cha nek palơq kabhuh pagoop jêên lơq manưih ve matu?” <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Xong xók xâng paraaq ađek, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Manưih khe karơ kah ve đươi leq manưih payươh; bơơi nek manưih ka-ai dreh. Aku kah bhral buôn dhaloong manưih bhơt liêm, hơq nek manưih ve matu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Hayơq nôôq môôn-đô ưng Jang lơq manưih Pha-ri-si xók điêng cha, piđó kung tơk lơq tamóh Ađó: “Taai hau rau hơq môôn-đô ưng Jang lơq môôn-đô ưng manưih Pha-ri-si điêng cha, bơơi môôn-đô ưng thêi kah điêng cha?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Tamóói tơơt bhiêk nhan akóón kah chóóm điêng cha tơk xók chaxaau dyơq tơơt palơq piđó, pâng kah? Hơq mơ đươnh piđó ve chaxaau tơơt palơq ađêi, nek piđó kah chóóm điêng cha. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Bơơi nôôq tangêi e tơk, nek bhêêl hơq chaxaau ơi bâân đââng vôôiq tââq piđó, nek xók achêk, piđó e điêng cha kalóóng nôôq tangêi ađek. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Kah ngaai bươl mưi tala bhaai tame leq m'beq aau ti, bơơi la kơi ve ngaai têêng kơi achêk, nek têêng tachatang taheek phơn rabươl dhiq aau, dham bhaai tame palơq bhaai ti, hayơq dham taheek val vaaih môôp lơh. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Kah ngaai kađôôq buôh tame kalóóng aluui ng'kar ti, bơơi la kơi ve ngaai têêng kơi achêk, nek buôh e têêng pađóh aluui ng'kar, hayơq miq buôh lơq aluui ng'kar maar bâân hư, klóóih leq ađek, buôh tame tơơt kalóóng aluui ng'kar tame.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Tarnêêng yuur vaaih leq tangêi Sa-baat, xók Ađó vôôiq kóh lalơh nôôq hare aviq, nôôq môôn-đô Ađó tââp xruôt kanuung aviq mi xók bhêêl vôôiq kalơng. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Manưih Pha-ri-si móón palơq Ađó: “Lêi tôôh, hau kabhuh piđó têêng rau kah chóóm pheep kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat?” <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Ađó ââi piđó: “Nôôq pe kah ve glêh đok tarnêêng Đa-viit — bhua lơq nôôq manưih ting vôôiq palơq ađêi, ơi têêng xók bhua ve kiêng đươi lơq ha-ul alua? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Ng'kơi hơq ađó ơi vôôiq mót đong Yaang Pleng kalóóng đơơi takóh kadhâng bhanuôih A-bia-tha lơq cha beng ơi bhuôih, nek beng kah chóóm pheep cha, chapiên nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih, lơq ađó kung nh'xóóng đóng nôôq manưih xók tơơt nek palơq ađêi.” <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Chuôq praaq palơq piđó: “Tangêi Sa-baat bâân yuur tavaaih taai akóón manưih, bơơi eh rau akóón manưih taai tangêi Sa-baat. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Taai kơi achêk, Akóón Manưih nek Chuôq, chênh bhơt ưng tangêi Sa-baat.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Ađó vil vôôiq mót leq đong gươl, lơq mưi chanak ve tapaang têi bâân adyóói xók tơơt dhiq ađek. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Palââng choop lêi Ađó pagiit, ve kah Ađó e payươh manưih achêk kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat, hơq đóng piđó ve chóóm kaauq matu Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Ađó kayua manưih ve tapaang têi bâân adyóói: “Phaai dyương leq pa-ô m'pơng.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Lơq Ađó tamóh piđó: “Tangêi Sa-baat chóóm pheep têêng liêm môôiq têêng môôp; paq manưih môôiq leng manưih?” Bơơi piđó parngau. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Xong xók dhiêr mat lêi piđó palơq lóóm pagrâ, ka-ai karuôq taai rau nhâng lóóm ưng piđó, Ađó praaq palơq manưih padruuih: “Phaai yuôih pagluh tapaang têi ưng amei”. Ađó yuôih pagluh lơq tapaang têi ađó bâân kơi kaxu. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Lơq bhêêl ơi gluh leq nguôi, nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si palơq nôôq manưih mađó kabhuh Hê-rôôt n'drươh tapraaq mangê karnóq jơl lóóiq Ađó, ng'kơi têêng buôn piđó ve chóóm leng Ađó.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Chuôq Jê-su palơq nôôq môôn-đô Ađó róch leq hót taxiiq, lơq mưi tanóói dhanuôr bơk bhlơng ơi ting vôôiq tââq Ga-li-lê, tââq Ju-đê, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem, lơq tââq I-đu-mê nek palơq parah hót tóór tôôh karuung Jô-đen, kung kơi praang xirvir kanóón Ti-rơ lơq Si-đôôn. Ơi xâng n'nal n'đơq rau Chuôq têêng, mưi kabhuh ganơr bơk bhlơng ơi tóói tơk palơq Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Ađó kayua nôôq môôn-đô ađêi pasam đóng mưi beq bhuông katưưiq ravang lơơi đóng Ađó ơi taai tanóói dhanuôr, buôn piđó yươq kaxiêq Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Taai Ađó ơi payươh bơk manưih, tơk mơ la ngaai ve dhuôr ka-ai phaai paluôq pliên tơk griêq Ađó buôn ve chóóm xuui leq Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Dhơ dharau dyóp xók nôôq yaang môôp lêi Ađó, piđó maar gim mat leq katiêk toom Ađó, lơq piđó lalơu kariêh, praaq kơi ađô: “Amei nek Akóón Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Chuôq praaq parâng trêh teng piđó buôn piđó yươq truuih pakah leq Ađó.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Ađó vôôiq đơk leq bôôl lơq dhaloong nôôq manưih đu chênh Ađó kiêng, lơq piđó tơk palơq Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Ađó chaleq majêt bơơr chanak (nôôq manưih đu Ađó kung đóók nek nôôq sưưq-đô), buôn piđó tơơt palơq Ađó lơq buôn Ađó ve chóóm kayua piđó vôôiq truuih taruuih liêm, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Kung kơi đóng mataai raman viêng abhưi. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ađó chaleq majêt bơơr chanak: Palơq Si-môôn, Ađó đóók kơơq achak nek Phi-e-rơ; <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Ja-kơ, akóón padruuih Xê-bê-đê, lơq Jang, adhi ưng Ja-kơ, nek nôôq manưih Ađó kung đóók kơơq achak nek Bô-a-neet, kiêng móón nek nôôq akóón padruuih ưng katiing kamlaaq; <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />nek palơq En-rê, Phi-liip, Ba-thê-lê-mi, Ma-thi-ơ, Thô-ma, Ja-kơ akóón padruuih A-phê, Tha-đê, Si-môôn Xê-lôôt, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />lơq Ju-đa Ich-ka-ri-ôôt, kung nek manưih tamôôp Ađó.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Chuôq mót kalóóng mưi dhanong đong, lơq tanóói dhanuôr vil ting tóói pơh, tơk mơ Ađó palơq nôôq môôn-đô pamơ kah chóóm bâân cha beng. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Xók nôôq manưih dharing tapóóng Chuôq xâng kơi achêk, piđó tơk buôn kóóp jư Ađó, ơi piđó móón kơi ađô: “Ađó achêk bhôh aq.” <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Nôôq thêi pachóóm gani, nek nôôq manưih vôôiq dhuônh tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem, móón kơi ađô: “Ađó ơi bâân Bê-êên-xê-buun bóq,” lơq kơi ađô: “Ganơơm takóh abhưi hơq Ađó ađek viêng abhưi.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Bơơi xók ơi dhaloong piđó tơk leq ađêi, Ađó praaq palơq piđó palơq babi: “Ng'kơi têêng Sa-taan ve chóóm viêng Sa-taan? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />La mưi katiêk bâân tablah tư tarjơl lóóiq chênh ađó, nek katiêk achêk kah chóóm dyương mưng dyơq. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />La mưi đong bâân tablah tư tarjơl lóóiq chênh ađó, nek đong achêk e kah chóóm mưng đươnh dyơq. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Lơq la Sa-taan yuur vaaih tarjơl lóóiq chênh ađêi hơq bâân tablah, nek ađó kah chóóm dyương mưng, bơơi ơi tơk bhêêl chêt bil. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Lalêi palơq tarnêêng tư tarjơl lóóiq chênh ađêi, xók ơi mót kalóóng đong ưng mưi manưih karơ praan, kah ngaai ve chóóm n'drooih pei drươp kavaan ưng ađó ađek laloom tââm ơi bâân choq manưih karơ praan achêk laloom, xong tatun ađek hayơq n'drooih pei đong ađó. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Alua, aku móón nôôq pe, kơi dyóp matu lơt ưng akóón anaaq akóón manưih e bâân lơơi, pamơ dhơ dharau paraaq chôlô n'đó piđó yuur praaq, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />dhơ kơi ađek la ngaai praaq matu jơl lóóiq Chuôq Yaang Liêm, nek kah ve bâân lơơi matu tơk taluôn luôn, bơơi manưih achêk bâân mơk matu taluôn luôn.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Chuôq praaq kơi achêk taai piđó móón: “Ađó ađek bâân yaang môôp bóq.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Amêêq Ađó palơq nôôq adhi ưng Ađó tơk, lơq xók dyương hót nguôi, piđó kayua manưih pató bóóp đóng Ađó, dhaloong Ađó gluh. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Mưi kabhuh ganơr xók tơơt praang Ađó, lơq palââng móón palơq Ađó: “Lêi tôôh, amêêq thêi palơq nôôq adhi anó thêi dhiq nguôi, xók chik-chêk thêi.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Ââi lóóiq piđó, Ađó praaq: “Ngaai nek amêêq Aku lơq nôôq adhi anó Aku?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Hayơq xong xók hangiêk mat lêi nôôq manưih xók tơơt xirvir praang ađêi, Ađó praaq: “Phaai lêi ađô, amêêq aku lơq nôôq adhi anó aku! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Ơi la ngaai têêng kơi kanóq kiêng Yaang Pleng, ađek nek adhi anó, mamóóq adhi, lơq amêêq Aku.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Mưi chu dyơq, Ađó tââp tarnââp truuih pachóóm hót tóór taxiiq, lơq mưi tanóói dhanuôr bơk bhlơng karong lóóiq praang xirvir Ađó. Taai kơi achêk, Ađó ơi jađaang mót leq mưi beq bhuông dhiq taxiiq buôn tơơt dhiq ađek, hayơq luch tanóói dhanuôr tơơt dhiq tóór taxiiq. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Chuôq pachóóm piđó bơk rau palơq babi, lơq kalóóng rau pató pachóóm ưng ađêi, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Phaai xâng nô! Tôôh, mưi manưih têêng hare vôôiq gluh chóói m'ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Tarnêêng yuur vaaih xók ađó chóói haró, masôôq haró ruuh tóór kalơng lơq achim tơk chóh luch nôôq ađek. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Nôôq kaliêng lââng ruuh dhiq dhơl dyriên, nek dhiq kah ve bơk katiêk mathuk, lơq ađó yuur chat n'drươh nek, taai kah n'lót dhơuq leq katiêk. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Xók mat tangêi yuur blo, chanoh bâân parang klaaq róh, lơq taai kah ve riêh, hayơq piđó bâân rang vet. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Nôôq lââng ruuh nham m'pơng nôôq nhanhuk axông, axông yuur chat kaxiêq garet ađó, lơq ađó kah vaaih pô pale rau chóóm. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Nôôq kaliêng lââng dyơq ruuh dhiq katiêk liêm, ting kaliêng đââng tơk kaliêng kanuung, xók yuur chat hayơq bâân gamak, lơq ađó bóóng pale vaaih pe jêt, vaaih chapat jêt, lơq vaaih mưi hariêng.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Lơq Ađó praaq: “Ngaai ve katór buôn xâng, phaai xâng.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Xók Chuôq tơơt n'tua mưi ađêi, nôôq manưih tơơt praang Ađó palơq majêt bơơr sưưq-đô tamóh Ađó leq nôôq babi ađek. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Rau đu lalââp leq katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng ơi bâân đóng leq adhi anó, bơơi palơq nôôq manưih nguôi, dyóp rau maar nek palơq babi,<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />buôn xók lêi, nek piđó bhiêk ve lêi, hơq kah chóóm lêi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">xók xâng, nek piđó bhiêk ve xâng, hơq kah chóóm n'nal,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">e vaaih, piđó klôôq lóóm lơq matu bâân lơơi đóng piđó.”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Adhi anó kah n'nal babi ađô alua? Kơi achêk nek ng'kơi têêng adhi anó n'nal paluch nôôq babi? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Manưih chóói haró achêk chóói paraaq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Hayơq ađôk nek nôôq manưih hót tóór kalơng dhiq hơq paraaq Yaang Pleng bâân tachóói, hơq xók piđó xâng paraaq achêk, Sa-taan n'drươh tơk lơq n'drooih bil paraaq Yaang Pleng ơi bâân tachóói dhiq piđó. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Kung kơi achêk, ađôk nek nôôq manưih dhiq dhơl dyriên xók bâân tachóói, chênh nek manưih hơq xók piđó xâng paraaq Yaang Pleng, n'drươh pơh đơơp paraaq Yaang Pleng palơq bhuui marhaal, <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />hơq piđó kah ve riêh kalóóng ađêi hơq chapiên nek maxưưiq. Achêk nek xók bhrê hư môôiq kóóp janah yuur vaaih ơi taai paraaq Yaang Pleng, piđó n'drươh bil lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Sôôq lââng nek nôôq manưih m'pơng nhanhuk axông bâân tachóói paraaq Yaang Pleng. Ađôk nek nôôq manưih xâng paraaq Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />hơq nôôq lóóm kanóq karaang leq đơơi ađôk lơq marlóóch ưng rau karvaan kabhôôq, palơq lóóm n'thaam kiêng bơk rau lââng mót kachóóq, garet phet paraaq Yaang Pleng lơq ađó val xar kah bóóng pale. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Lơq ađôk nek nôôq manưih dhiq katiêk liêm bâân chóói paraaq Yaang Pleng, chênh nek nôôq manưih xâng paraaq Yaang Pleng lơq pei đơơp, hayơq vaaih pô bóóng pale, vaaih pe jêt, vaaih chapat jêt, lơq vaaih mưi hariêng.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Chuôq móón piđó: “Dhơu bat aang eh rau buôn bâân patơơt dhiq hôk môôiq raal karum dharââng pâng kah? Kah alua buôn ađó bâân patơơt dhiq dyung dhơu alua? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Ơi kah ve rau đu nek kadrêi lââp la eh rau nek buôn bâân tapakah, kung kah ve rau ơi yuur vaaih kơi đu lalââp hơq eh rau nek buôn đââng leq đu brương. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />La ngaai ve katór buôn xâng, phaai xâng.” <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Hayơq Chuôq praaq palơq piđó: “Phaai chamet rau adhi anó xâng. Adhi anó bang đang ting meen n'đơq, nek meen achêk e bâân bang đang đóng adhi anó lơq ađó e đóng lơh kơơq leq adhi anó dyơq. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Ơi ngaai manưih ve nek ađó e bâân đóng leq manưih achêk, hayơq manưih kah ve, nek patơk mơ rau hơq manưih achêk ve, e bâân pei lơơi tââq ađó.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Chuôq truuih: “Katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng nek kơi ađô: thê kơi mưi manưih tôôh chóói m'ma dhiq katiêk, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />ađó ađek bêch môôiq blââk, hayum môôiq tangêi, kaliêng m'ma bhiêk chamat lơq yuur gamak ng'kơi — chênh ađó kah n'nal. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Katiêk vaaih pô bóóng pale ting kơi ưng ađó: laloom tââm nek tââm xơq, tatun ađek tơk kanuung aviq, hayơq kaliêng kóp haleng dhiq kanuung achêk. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Hayơq xók nil aviq kriing rââk, ađó đâh pajaq pla kaliêm taai nil xóót ơi tơk.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Lơq Ađó praaq: “Nôôq he ve chóóm marchơng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng n'đó kơi, môôiq nôôq he ve chóóm pakah katiêk achêk palơq harau babi? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Thê kơi kaliêng habhêi, nek kaliêng hơq xók bâân choh leq katiêk, biêh nek katưưiq tââm kalóóng tabhơt nôôq m'ma kaliêng dhiq katiêk, <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />hơq xók ơi bâân choh xong, ađó yuur chat lơq val xar gamak lơh dyóp m'ma bhơơi kalóóng bhươn, lơq ađó chamat nôôq đóóng gamak, tơk mơ achim pleng ve chóóm têêng xaruh raal a-ô ađó.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Palơq bơk babi kơi achêk, Ađó pachóóm paraaq Yaang Pleng đóng piđó, ting mơ dhanang piđó ve chóóm xâng n'nal; <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />bơơi Ađó kah rau pachóóm đóng piđó hơq kah ve babi, dhơ kơi ađek xók tơơt panlei, Ađó lók dyóp rau đóng nôôq môôn-đô ađêi.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Kalóóng tangêi ađek, xók pleng ơi habu blót, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Nôôq he phaai chaang gan leq tóór hót tôôh.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Lơq xong xók xooq tââq tanóói dhanuôr, piđó đââng Ađó ting vôôiq palơq ađêi, taai Ađó biêh dyơq tơơt dhiq bhuông. Kung ve nôôq bhuông lââng ting Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Mưi garnhuh adhiiq bó gamak bhlơng yuur vaaih lơq ga-uul bhiêk n'dhươi leq bhuông patơk mơ bhuông đan bâân bing đơơk. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Hayơq chênh Ađó xók tơơt dhiq chađui bhuông, ganương ganôôiq bêch. Piđó payuur Ađó lơq móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi ơơi, thêi kah karaang nek nôôq he ravang chêt hơ?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Xong xók yuur blââk, Ađó trêh adhiiq lơq praaq palơq taxiiq: “Phaai parngau aq! Hangiêm aq!” Kơi achêk nek, adhiiq pat pruung, lơq ve hangiêm paluch. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Ađó tamóh piđó: “Hau adhi anó kakhin? Adhi anó dyơq kah ve lóóm huuiq hơ?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Piđó bâân braaih kakhin palơq vaaih kakhin kapơn pabhlơng lơq piđó praaq xóng piđó: “Kơi achêk Manưih ađô nek ngaai, ơi patơk mơ adhiiq lơq taxiiq phaai xâng bóóp Ađó?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Hayơq piđó vôôiq tơk tóór taxiiq hót tôôh, tơk parah katiêk Jê-ra-sê. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Xók Ađó gluh tââq bhuông, n'drươh mưi chanak bâân yaang môôp bóq gluh kêch Ađó tââq ping xaal. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Manưih ađô ve dham tơơt mamông kalóóng nôôq ping xaal, lơq kah ngaai ve đuôh kadhâng jư ađó ađek chóóm dyơq, patơk mơ pei tarlêi bhaxêi kung kah chóóm, <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />taai bơk chu ađó bâân taklooiq palơq kanum lơq xiêng, hơq tarlêi bhaxêi nek bâân ađó rươt tatươt, hayơq kanum nek bâân m'poh bhriq, lơq kah ngaai karơ đuôh buôn kadhâng ađó ađek. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Tóóng luch tangêi lơq hayum kalóóng nôôq bóng ping lơq dhiq nôôq bôôl booiq, ađó ađek gavơơu lalơu lơq gareh iêt achak ađêi palơq dhơl lơp huuch. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Xók lêi Chuôq Jê-su tââq changaai, ađó mut tơk lơq gim mat leq katiêk toom Chuôq. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Karơ dhariêng gavơơu lalơu, ađó ađek praaq: “Jê-su ơơi, Akóón ưng Yaang Pleng Bhơt Yaal, aku ve rau pâng kre palơq Amei? Aku nhan gavơh Amei ng'kóh toom Yaang Pleng, óóq têêng janah aku.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Taai Chuôq biêh ơi kayua đóng ađó, kơi ađô: “Yaang môôp tôôh, phaai gluh tââq manưih ađô.” <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Chuôq tamóh ađó: “Amei hau achak?” Ađó ââi palơq Chuôq: “Achak aku nek Kabhuh Linh, ơi nôôq yi bơk.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Hayơq abhưi bhiêk yayeen nhan gavơh Ađó kơi Amei óóq viêng nôôq piđó gluh tââq parah ađek. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Xók achêk, dhiq ađek ve mưi kanan adhââk lóng bơk xók bâân paloh cha dhiq bôôl, <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />hayơq piđó nhan panhel Chuôq, kơi ađô: “Nhan kayua đóng nôôq yi mót kalóóng kanan adhââk, buôn nôôq yi ve chóóm jaq leq piđó.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Ađó đóng pheep piđó, lơq xók ơi gluh nek nôôq yaang môôp jaq leq kanan adhââk, hayơq kanan adhââk — pađơq mơ bơơr ngaan panong — tââq bhung bôôl harluông đâh leq taxiiq lơq chêt thaleng dhiq taxiiq. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Nôôq manưih jư adhââk mut xooq lơq truuih lóóiq tarnêêng achêk kalóóng kanóón bơk dhanuôr lơq dhiq kanóón manưih m'bưưiq, hayơq bơk manưih pơh tơk buôn lêi hau tarnêêng ơi yuur vaaih. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Piđó tơk palơq Chuôq Jê-su lơq lêi manưih bâân abhưi bóq — nek manưih glêh bâân Kabhuh Linh abhưi mót bóq — xók tơơt dhiq ađek, chóóm xơp n'đóh tư têêq lơq tơơt kalóóng akoq abôk n'taach, nek piđó lóng kakhin kapơn. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Nôôq manưih ơi lêi truuih lóóiq đóng piđó tarnêêng ơi yuur vaaih n'đó kơi leq manưih bâân abhưi bóq lơq chiên leq kanan adhââk. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Lơq piđó pơơh bóóp nhan Ađó xooq tââq xưưq xaang ưng ađêi <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Xók Ađó bhadyaang mót leq bhuông, manưih ơi glêh bâân abhưi bóq nhan panhel Ađó buôn ađêi ve chóóm tơơt palơq Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Chuôq kah đóng pheep ađó, bơơi kayua đóng ađó: “Phaai chô leq đong amei, tơk palơq nôôq kabhuh ưng amei hơq truuih lóóiq đóng piđó tarnêêng gamak Chuôq ơi têêng dhiq amei lơq ng'kơi Ađó ơi pakah lóóm kayô ka-er amei.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Lơq hayơq, ađó gluh vôôiq lơq tââp truuih đuui kalóóng xưưq Đê-ka-bô-lơ tarnêêng gamak ng'kơi đu Chuôq Jê-su ơi têêng đóng ađêi, lơq dyóp ngaai maar chrih xâng.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Xong xók Chuôq Jê-su tơơt dhiq bhuông chaang gan tóór hót tôôh machu dyơq, mưi tanóói dhanuôr bơk bhlơng karong kaboq lóóiq praang Ađó, lơq Ađó xók tơơt dhiq tóór taxiiq. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Tôôh, mưi kalóóng nôôq manưih jư lêi đong gươl, achak nek Jaai-ru, vôôiq tơk, lơq xók lêi Chuôq, ađó chakoh takól dhiq dyung Chuôq. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Ađó panhel nhan gavơh Chuôq hơq praaq kơi ađô: “Akóón pađiil katưưiq ưng aku xók lóng ngơn bhlơng. Nhan Chuôq tơk buôn Chuôq lơơi têi dhiq ađó hơq đóng ađó ve chóóm bâân yươh lơq bâân mamông.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Kơi achêk nek Chuôq vôôiq palơq ađó, mưi tanóói dhanuôr lóng bơk kung vôôiq ting Ađó lơq kaxiêq praang xirvir Ađó.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ve mưi pađiil pakan ơi bâân dhuôr hóói ahaam majêt bơơr kamó, <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />ơi đơơp jarnah ka-ai kuôq bơk taai bơk manưih payươh lơq ơi pagluh sek dyóp rau karvaan ađêi, hơq kah rau đââng lóóiq malơơi, bơơi klóóih leq ađek, ka-ai dyơq xar ngơn lơh, <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />xong xók xâng leq Chuôq Jê-su, nek xók tơk đan hót hóng Chuôq m'pơng tanóói dhanuôr bơk, ađó rapơq leq aau Chuôq. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Ơi ađó kanóq kơi ađô: “La aku chapiên rapơq leq aau Chuôq giêl nek aku e bâân yươh.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />N'drươh, ka-ai ahaam hóói ưng ađó pat lóóiq, lơq ađó chóóm n'nal dhiq achak ađêi, kơi achak ađêi ơi bâân yươh tââq ka-ai. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />N'drươh, Chuôq Jê-su, bâân n'nal dhiq chênh ađêi nek mataai raman tââq ađêi ơi yuur gluh, hayơq palâh lóóiq m'pơng kabhuh ganơr, Ađó tamóh kơi ađô: “Ngaai ơi xuui leq aau ưng aku?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Nôôq môôn-đô Ađó móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi lêi kabhuh ganơr xók paliên kaxiêq thêi, hơq thêi dyơq tamóh: ‘Ngaai xuui leq aku’ hơ?” <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Chuôq dyơq xók lêi praang buôn lêi ngaai ơi têêng rau ađek. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Xók achêk, manưih pađiil pakan, taai ơi xar kakhin kapơn lơq hayer papreh, n'nal tarnêêng ơi yuur vaaih đóng ađêi, hayơq ơi tơk, gim mat leq katiêk toom Chuôq lơq truuih lóóiq đóng Chuôq pabhơt rau lalua. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Bơơi Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “Akóón pađiil ơơi, lóóm huuiq akóón ơi payươh akóón. Phaai vôôiq kalóóng yươq rau ha lơq bâân yươh karơ tââq dhuôr ka-ai ưng akóón.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Kalóóng bhêêl Ađó dyơq xók praaq, ve nôôq manưih tââq đong ưng manưih jư lêi đong gươl tơk truuih kơi ađô: “Akóón pađiil ưng amei ơi chêt. Hau hayơq têêng panhok thêi dyơq?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Bơơi xók bâân xâng paraaq piđó móón, Chuôq Jê-su móón manưih jư lêi đong gươl: “Óóq kakhin. Chapiên mưi huuiq giêl.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ađó kah đóng pheep ngaai lââng ting vôôiq palơq ađêi chapiên Phi-e-rơ, Ja-kơ lơq Jang, adhi Ja-kơ. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ađó vôôiq tơk đong ưng manưih jư lêi đong gươl lơq lêi lum nhôôn nhaauq palơq nhiim griit lơq lalơu lalaang ka-uôih bhangơr. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Xók bhadyaang mót, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Hau nôôq pe ranguôq rangóót lơq nhiim griit? Akóón paniên yươq chêt, hơq ađó bêch giêl.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Kơi achêk nek kabhuh piđó kachang ajóóch Ađó, bơơi xók ơi chuih bhơt kabhuh piđó gluh leq nguôi, Ađó đââng ting ama, amêêq ưng akóón paniên lơq nôôq manưih vôôiq palơq Ađó, hayơq Chuôq Jê-su tơk dham akóón paniên bêch. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Xong xók kadhâng têi akóón paniên, Ađó kayua akóón pađiil: “Ta-li-tha, kum!” paraaq achêk nek bâân lóók nek: “Akóón pađiil katưưiq, aku kayua akóón phaai yuur blââk.” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />N'drươh, akóón pađiil yuur tơơt lơq bhadyaang vôôiq (taai ơi đuôh majêt bơơr tuôi), lơq nôôq manưih dhiq ađek lóng kadrêq lêi, lêi chrih pabhlơng. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ađó praaq pagat pató piđó kơi kah mưi ngaai chóóm n'nal tarnêêng ađô, lơq Ađó kayua piđó đóng akóón pađiil cha.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Tââq dhiq ađek, Ađó ơi yuur vôôiq, hayơq chô tơk bhươl kanóón ưng ađêi, lơq nôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó vôôiq ting Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Tơk tangêi Sa-baat, Ađó tââp truuih pachóóm kalóóng đong gươl. Bơk manưih xâng bâân chrih lêi, praaq kơi ađô: “Nôôq paraaq truuih pachóóm ađô n'tââq pei pagluh? Đu tarbech galang ơi bâân đóng leq ađó ađô palơq nôôq raman chrih kơi đu tôôh yuur vaaih tââq têi ađó ađek nek ng'kơi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Eh dhơq ađô nek tadhươm têêng tarnêêng kóóch chan, akóón padruuih ưng Ma-ri, lơq anó padruuih ưng Ja-kơ, Jô-sê, Ju-đe lơq Si-môôn alua? Eh dhơq nôôq adhi pađiil ưng ađó achêk xók tơơt dhiq ađô m'pơng nôôq he alua?” Piđó bâân praaq tamôôp leq Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó kơi ađô: “Manưih đââng taruuih nek kah hat rau bhi chap, chapiên dhiq xưưq xaang ađêi, kalóóng kabhuh xóng anó ađêi lơq dhiq manưih đong ađêi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Ađó kah chóóm têêng dhơ dharau n'đó tarnêêng mataai raman dhiq ađek, chapiên Ađó ơi payươh ka-ai xók lơơi têi dhiq m'bưưiq bhlơng manưih ka-ai. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Ađó lêi chrih ơi taai lóóm kah huuiq ưng piđó, hayơq Ađó vôôiq truuih pachóóm praang nôôq bhươl kanóón.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Ađó dhaloong majêt bơơr sưưq-đô lơq tââp kayua piđó yuur vôôiq, tabơơr chanak, Ađó kung đóng leq piđó mataai raman dhiq nôôq yaang môôp, <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />lơq praaq pató piđó kơi óóq rau đââng ting xók vôôiq kalơng, chapiên mưi tarlââng giêl — kah beng, kah chadhung, kung kah jêên baak kalóóng xaneet tarveng — <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />hơq ve đâq jêi dheep, lơq “Adhi anó óóq xơp bơơr aau.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Lơq Ađó kayua đóng piđó: “Hơq xók adhi anó mót leq kalóóng ngaai đong, phaai bhiêk tơơt dhiq ađek đóng tơk xók bhêêl adhi anó yuur vôôiq tââq đong achêk. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Dhơ dhakơi n'đó dhiq kah pơh yaauq adhi anó, môôiq kah đơơp xâng adhi anó, nek xók xooq tââq ađek, phaai tapiêh puui dhiq dyung ađêi kơi đóng lêi jaklâk jơl piđó.” <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Kơi achêk nek, xong xók yuur vôôiq, piđó truuih pachóóm kơi dyóp ngaai kơng phaai klôôq lóóm. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Piđó viêng bơk abhưi, lơq chadrươh xut dhơu đóng bơk manưih ka-ai lơq payươh piđó.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Kơi achêk hayơq, bhua Hê-rôôt ơi xâng đââr taruuih ađô, ơi tanđôôr achak Chuôq ơi val xar bơk ngaai n'nal, lơq palââng praaq kơi ađô: “Jang Bap-tiit ơi bâân têêng đóng mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt, taai ađek nôôq raman chrih mataai karơ xók yuur têêng dhiq manưih ađô.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Hayơq nôôq manưih lââng praaq kơi ađô: “Ađó ađek nek Ê-li.” Hơq sôôq lââng dyơq praaq ađek nek: “Mưi manưih đââng taruuih, thê kơi mưi kalóóng nôôq yaang đââng taruuih.” <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Bơơi xók xâng kơi achêk, Hê-rôôt móón kơi ađô: “Jang, manưih hơq aku têch akoq, ađó achêk ơi bâân têêng đóng mamông lóóiq.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Ơi chênh Hê-rôôt, ơi kayua manưih, kóóp Jang lơq klooiq ađó kalóóng đong kanam leq tarnêêng Hê-rô-đia (kađiêl ưng Phi-liip, adhi padruuih bhua) ơi taai bhua ơi pei amooq ađek. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Taai Jang ơi praaq palơq Hê-rôôt kơi ađô: “Alua nek lơt gani xók bhua pei kađiêl ưng adhi padruuih ađêi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Bơơi Hê-rô-đia môôp lóóm ađó lơq kiêng leng ađó, bơơi amooq ađek kah chóóm, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />taai Hê-rôôt kakhin Jang, ơi n'nal ađó nek manưih bhơt liêm lơq liêm kre, hayơq bhua jư đóng ađó bâân yươq rau ha, dhơ xók xâng ađó praaq, bhlua lóng kadhaap lóóm, hơq bhua dyơq bhơt lóóm tameng xâng ađó. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Hayơq xók tơk bhêêl xók kre dhalam, nek xók Hê-rôôt dhoon dhanah chana hei tangêi ađêi n'niên yaauq nôôq kuôn gamak ưng ađêi palơq nôôq bhalơng linh, lơq kabhuh têêng gamak parah Ga-li-lê, <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />nek bhêêl ađek akóón pađiil Hê-rô-đia ưng bhua ơi bhadyaang mót, tanâât yayaq, lơq têêng Hê-rôôt palơq nôôq tamóói madhiq baang palơq bhua lóng iêm lóóm, hayơq bhua ơi praaq palơq akóón pađiil: “Phaai nhan tââq aku bhơt dhơ dharau akóón kiêng lơq aku e đóng ađó leq akóón.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Ađó praaq ng'kóh palơq pađiil kơi ađô: “Dhơ akóón nhan aku, tơk m'pơng katiêk karuung ưng aku, aku e kung đóng akóón.” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Kơi achêk nek, xong xók gluh leq nguôi, akóón pađiil tamóh amêêq ađêi: “Akóón chóóm nhan harau?” Hayơq ađó ađek ââi: “M'beq akoq ưng Jang Bap-tiit.” <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />N'drươh ađek, kalóóng đu tahươk tahơn xók palâh val lóóiq palơq bhua, akóón pađiil nhan: “Akóón kiêng nek n'drươh xók ađôk bhua đóng leq akóón m'beq akoq ưng Jang Bap-tiit lơơi dhiq pươih.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Dhơ val xar lóng ranguôq lóóm, bơơi bhua kah chóóm kah đóng ađó ơi taai paraaq ng'kóh ưng ađêi lơq nôôq tamóói xók tơơt madhiq baang palơq ađêi, <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />hayơq bhua n'drươh, kayua linh kadhâng bhươt, kayua đââng akoq ưng Jang tơk, lơq xong xók gluh leq nguôi, ađó vôôiq têch akoq Jang kalóóng đong kanam. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Ađó đââng akoq ưng Jang lơơi dhiq pươih lơq đóng ađó leq akóón pađiil, hayơq akóón pađiil đóng ađó lóóiq leq amêêq ađêi. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Xók ơi xâng n'nal chiên, nôôq môôn-đô ưng Jang tơk, pei xaak ađó, lơq đââng ađó vôôiq tơp kalóóng ping.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Nôôq sưưq-đô nhoom lóóiq palơq Chuôq Jê-su, truuih đóng Ađó dyóp tarnêêng piđó ơi têêng lơq nôôq rau piđó ơi pachóóm. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Ađó kayua piđó: “Chênh adhi anó phaai tư vôôiq tơk n'dhiq đu n'tua ranguôq rabaang, lơq phaai dhêi drơq maxưưiq.” Ơi ve lóng bơk manưih vôôiq lalơh manưih vôôiq val, lơq piđó patơk mơ kah ve nek bhêêl buôn chacha. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Piđó palơq xóng piđó vôôiq dyók leq bhuông tơk mưi dhiq bhahi bhatoong. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Bơk manưih ơi lêi piđó yuur vôôiq lơq đâh n'nal piđó, hayơq tââq plok nôôq charvaal, palââng ơi mandrươh mut dyung tơk ađek lơq tơk ađek laloom piđó. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Xók ơi bhadyaang gluh tââq bhuông, Ađó lêi mưi tanóói dhanuôr lóng bơk, lơq Ađó vaaih lóóm kayô ka-er piđó taai piđó thê kơi trưưu kah ve manưih jư, hayơq Ađó tââp tanââp pachóóm piđó bơk rau. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Bhêêl ađek ơi trê aq, hayơq xók tơk palơq Ađó, nôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó móón kơi ađô: “Dhiq ađô nek dham bhahi bhatoong lơq bhêêl ađô habu hayum bhlơng aq. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Nhan đóng dhanuôr yuur chô, buôn xong xók vôôiq mót nôôq bhươl kanóón praang xirvir ađôk, nek piđó ve chóóm tư kakơl ve rau buôn cha.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Bơơi xók ââi piđó, Ađó kayua: “Adhi anó phaai đóng piđó cha.” Piđó ââi palơq Ađó: “Xók ơi vôôiq, ve kơq nôôq yi ve chóóm đuôh kơl bơơr hariêng đơ-ni-ê beng hơq đââng đóng dhanuôr manưih cha hơ?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Kơi achêk hayơq, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Phaai vôôiq. Achêk lêi. Adhi anó ve n'đó mơ beq beng?” Xong xók achêk tamóh, piđó móón: “Xââng beq beng lơq bơơr panong kadhóóng.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ađó kayua đóng pabhơt dhanuôr tơơt chok leq xar ting nhoom dhiq bhơơi taviêng. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Piđó tơơt yuur blah nôôq nhoom blah xar mưi hariêng manưih lơq xar xââng jêt manưih. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Xong xók kadhâng xââng beq beng lơq bơơr panong kadhóóng, chaling mat leq pleng, Ađó ma-ơ lơq pei veh beng hayơq pađơơp đóng nôôq môôn-đô ađêi buôn piđó đââng nh'xóóng leq dhanuôr, Ađó kung pei blah bơơr panong kadhóóng đóng dyóp ngaai. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Piđó maar cha lơq bâân kabhôôq kajrê. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Lơq piđó chââih karong bâân majêt bơơr jong bing nôôq paleh beng lêêk lơq kadhóóng. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Nôôq manưih ơi cha beng dhơơm ve xââng ngaan manưih padruuih.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />N'drươh, Ađó chut kayua nôôq môôn-đô ađêi bhadyaang dyók leq bhuông lơq vôôiq laloom chaang tóór hót tôôh, tơk Bêêt-saai-đa, dyơq xók Ađó đóng dhanuôr chô. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Xók piđó ơi tââp vôôiq, Ađó vôôiq đơk leq bôôl buôn nhan gavơh. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Tơk hayum, bhuông ơi dhiq m'pơng taxiiq, lơq Ađó tơơt mưi ađêi dhiq katiêk kakóóng. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Lêi piđó xók tabhơt karơ chông vơq — taai xók adhiiq chachriik palơq piđó — nek pamơ bhêêl đan brương hayum achêk, Ađó vôôiq dyung dhiq m'piing taxiiq tơk dhiq piđó lơq Ađó kiêng jalơh piđó. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Bơơi xók ve lêi Ađó bhadyaang vôôiq dhiq m'piing taxiiq, piđó ngóq kơi ađek nek abhưi, hayơq piđó reen dheek karơ, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />taai piđó maar ve lêi Ađó lơq bâân braaih kakhin. Bơơi n'drươh, Ađó praaq palơq piđó lơq móón piđó: “Phaai mưng lóóm! Nek thêi ađô! Óóq kakhin!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ađó bhadyaang mót kalóóng bhuông palơq piđó lơq dhiiq n'dhương hangiêm, nôôq môôn-đô ve kakhin kapơn pabhlơng dhiq m'pơng kalóóng piđó. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Taai piđó ơi kah n'nal leq mataai chrih paxar beng, klóóih leq ađek, lóóm piđó bhiêk dyơq nhâng karđiq.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Xók ơi chaang gan hót tóór tôôh, piđó vôôiq tơk Gê-nê-xa-rêêt lơq choq bhuông dhiq ađek. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Xók piđó gluh tââq bhuông, taai đâh n'nal Ađó n'drươh, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />hayơq palââng vôôiq mut plok xưưq achêk lơq tââp glâk nôôq manưih pâng ka-ai dhiq dharââng tơk dham hơq piđó xâng kơi Ađó xók dhiq ađek. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Hơq dhơ tadhiq Ađó vôôiq mót, kalóóng nôôq bhươl, môôiq kalóóng kanóón manưih bơk môôiq kalóóng kanóón manưih m'bưưiq, dhanuôr maar đââng nôôq manưih ka-ai tabêch dhiq dham kalơng chơơq lơq nhan Ađó buôn kah mơ lââng piđó ve chóóm xuui leq xrooi aau ưng Ađó, lơq mak ngaai manưih đu xuui leq Ađó maar bâân yươh ka-ai.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si palơq nôôq thêi pachóóm gani, ơi tơk tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem, xók karong lóóiq praang xirvir Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Taai ơi lêi masôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó, xók piđó cha beng palơq tapaang têi anhuq, hơq nek kah raau. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Ơi manưih Pha-ri-si kung kơi tabhơt manưih Jo Thaaiq maar kah cha vaar la kah raau têi ađêi pagiit, taai xâng katiêu pachóóm bóóp ưng abhươp ama; <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />lơq rau đââng tââq chơơq chô, piđó kah cha la kah raau sek, lơq dyơq bơk rau lââng hơq piđó ơi pei đơơp buôn ting đuui: tarnêêng raau choom dhia, goq góói, lơq nôôq ađô karđôôq palơq kóng.) <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si lơq thêi pachóóm gani tamóh Chuôq: “Taai ng'hau môôn-đô ưng thêi kah mamông ting pachóóm bóóp ưng abhươp ama, hơq vil cha beng palơq têi kah raau?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Bơơi xók ââi bóóp piđó, Ađó móón kơi ađô: “Ê-saai praaq taruuih Yaang Pleng lóng dhalam leq nôôq manưih paliêm pakre hót nguôi nôôq pe. Kơi ve xaraq nô kơi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Dhanuôr ađô bhi chap aku dhiq koq bưưr tu n'taak</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">bơơi lóóm ưng piđó nek bhlưa changaai tââq aku.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Hayơq piđó bhuôih haanh aku kơi kah malơơi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">xók pachóóm nôôq rau gani ưng akóón manưih kơi ngóq nôôq gani.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />M'peq lơơi paraaq râng ưng Yaang Pleng, nôôq pe jư ting đu ti ưng akóón manưih.” <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Lơq Ađó praaq piđó: “Nôôq pe alua tarbech kah đươi paraaq râng ưng Yaang Pleng buôn xâng jư đu ti ưng ađêi! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Ơi Môôi-se pachóóm: ‘Phaai bhi chap ama ađêi palơq amêêq ađêi,’ lơq ‘Manưih đu tóh ama môôiq amêêq, manưih ađek phaai đơơp xariêq palơq akan chêt.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Bơơi nôôq pe móón: ‘La mưi nak praaq palơq ama môôiq amêêq ađêi: “Hayơq rau đu ama amêêq đaang bâân paar gamang tââq akóón nek Ko-baan (chênh nek bhanuôih tapôông leq Yaang Pleng),”’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />nek nôôq pe kah đóng pheep manưih ađek têêng dhơ dharau đóng ama môôiq amêêq ưng ađêi dyơq, <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />têêng paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng xar kơi kah rauriq palơq đu ti ưng nôôq pe hơq nôôq pe ơi truuih lóóiq, lơq nôôq pe têêng bơk rau makơi kơi achêk.” <verse eid="MRK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Lơq xong xók vil dhaloong dhanuôr manưih tơk, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Tabhơt adhi anó phaai xâng aku lơq phaai n'nal: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Kah ve rau tââq hót nguôi mưi nak mót kalóóng manưih achêk hơq ve chóóm têêng anhuq manưih achêk; bơơi nôôq rau tââq hót kalóóng gluh tââq ađó hayơq nek nôôq rau têêng anhuq palââng.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />(La ngaai ve katór buôn xâng, phaai xâng.)<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Xók Ađó vôôiq mót leq đong, changaai tââq manưih ganơr, nôôq môôn-đô Ađó tamóh Ađó leq babi. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Kơi achêk hơq adhi anó kung kah ve rau n'nal hơ? Adhi anó kah n'nal lêi kơi dyóp rau tââq hót nguôi mót kalóóng mưi nak kah chóóm têêng anhuq manưih achêk chóóm hơ? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Taai ađó yươh vôôiq mót leq kalóóng lóóm manưih, hơq nek mót leq luônh, hayơq bâân pagluh leq kalóóng đong kapóóng (chóóm n'nal nek dyóp tarmông maar sek se.)” <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Bơơi Ađó praaq kơi ađô: “Rau gluh tââq manưih hayơq nek rau têêng anhuq palââng. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Ơi dhiq hót kalóóng, yuur vaaih tââq kalóóng lóóm akóón manưih, vaaih gluh nôôq karnóq aak, tapiing taniêt, tatông papei, leng manưih, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />têêng tapiing, n'thaam, lóóm aak, chachââr galơơk, ơm cha xaxưa, akóón mat makhinh, tóh đua, i-thi, pacha lóóm. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Dyóp rau aak ađô tââq hót kalóóng vaaih gluh lơq piđó têêng anhuq palââng.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Hayơq xók yuur dyương tââq ađek, Ađó vôôiq tơk parah Ti-rơ lơq Si-đôôn, lơq xók ơi mót leq kalóóng mưi dhanong đong, Ađó kah kiêng ngaai n'nal, hơq kah đuôh palââp ađêi chóóm. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Bơơi n'drươh, mưi pađiil parkan tôôh, nek manưih ve akóón pađiil katưưiq ưng ađó bâân yaang môôp bóq, taai ơi xâng leq Ađó, hayơq xók tơk, ađó pađam chak dhiq dyung Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Xók achêk, manưih pađiil parkan achêk nek manưih Hi-laap, dhong nooi Si-rô-phê-ni-xi, lơq ađó nhan gavơh Chuôq buôn Ađó viêng abhưi gluh tââq akóón pađiil ađêi. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Ađó praaq palơq pađiil: “Laloom tââm, phaai lơơi akóón anaaq bâân cha đóng kabhôôq kơ, ơi lalua nek kah liêm xók pei beng ưng akóón anaaq lơq m'peq đóng anuq akóón.” <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Bơơi ađó ââi lóóiq lơq móón palơq Chuôq: “Pâng kơi achêk, Chuôq ơơi, lơq nôôq anuq akóón dhiq raal baang cha tââq nôôq beng lêêk ưng akóón anaaq.” <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Kơi achêk nek Chuôq kayua ađó: “Taai paraaq ađô, amei phaai chô aq. Abhưi ơi gluh tââq akóón pađiil ưng amei.” <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Xók val chô tơk đong ađêi, ađó lêi akóón paniên bêch dhiq dharââng, lơq abhưi ơi gluh xooq.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Lơq mưi chu dyơq, xong xók xooq tââq parah Ti-rơ, Ađó vôôiq kóh pagan kanóón Si-đôôn tơk taxiiq Ga-li-lê, tơk dhiq m'pơng parah Đê-ka-bô-lơ. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Palââng đââng tơk đóng Ađó mưi manưih tung lơq kabróól, hayơq piđó nhan gavơh Ađó, hơq đóng Ađó lơơi têi dhiq ađó ađek. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Xók ơi tư ađêi đââng manưih achêk gluh tââq manưih ganơr, Chuôq lơơi nôôq kabró têi ađêi leq bơơr bóng katór ađó, lơq xók kathui havi xong, Chuôq xut leq n'taak ađó. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Lơq chaling mat leq pleng, Chuôq hââm pađuôiq, hayơq praaq palơq ađó: “Ep-pha-ta,” (kiêng móón nek: “Phaai lóng aq!”). <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Kơi achêk nek katór ađó achêk bâân tarlóng, kadhaap dhiq n'taak ađó bâân taplók, lơq ađó tââp tanââp praaq drêh dróói. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Ađó pagat piđó buôn piđó kah praaq palơq ngaai. Bơơi Ađó dhaang pagat piđó n'đó mơ, piđó vil dhaang yuur truuih taruuih achêk bơk lơh mơ achêk. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Palââng chrih lêi bhlơng, praaq kơi ađô: “Ađó achêk ơi têêng dyóp tarnêêng lalua liêm kre. Patơk mơ, ađó achêk têêng đóng manưih tung chóóm xâng lơq manưih a-ơp chóóm praaq.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Kalóóng nôôq tangêi ađek, vil ve mưi tanóói dhanuôr lóng bơk, lơq kah rau ve buôn cha, xong xók dhaloong nôôq môôn-đô ađêi, Chuôq praaq palơq piđó: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Thêi kayô ka-er tanóói dhanuôr ađô, ơi piđó bhiêk tơơt palơq thêi ơi pe tangêi aq hơq kah rau ve đóng cha châ. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />La thêi kayua đóng piđó val chô leq đong piđó palơq luônh ha-ul, nek piđó e charbươp chóók kalơng, hơq masôôq manưih kalóóng piđó ơi bhral tââq kanóón changaai bhlơng.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Nôôq môôn-đô Ađó ââi palơq Ađó kơi ađô: “Ngaai manưih dhiq đôk, tơơt dham bhahi bhatoong ađô, ve chóóm pei n'tââq hơq đóng tanóói dhanuôr kơi ađô cha beng kơq?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Ađó tamóh piđó: “Adhi anó ve n'đơq beq beng?” Piđó ââi: “Tapól beq.” <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ađó kayua đóng tanóói dhanuôr tơơt leq katiêk, lơq xong xók pei tapól beq beng, ma-ơơn, Ađó pei veh hayơq pađơơp đóng nôôq môôn-đô ađêi buôn piđó ve chóóm đââng têêng yaauq, kơi achêk nek piđó pei dhoon đóng tanóói dhanuôr. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Lơq piđó ve nôôq panong kadhóóng katưưiq, hayơq xong xók ma-ơơn leq piđó, Ađó kayua piđó kung nh'xóóng phơn kadhóóng ađô dyơq. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Dhanuôr cha lơq bâân kabhôôq kajrê, hayơq piđó karong bâân tapól jong beng lêêk dyơq xưa. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Xók achêk, ve mơ puôn ngaan manưih, hayơq Ađó đóng piđó chô. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />N'drươh, xong xók mót kalóóng bhuông palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi, Ađó vôôiq tơk parah Đa-ma-nu-tha.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si tabhral lơq tââp tanââp tarkaai palơq Ađó, chêk-tabâân dhiq Ađó mưi karnal chrih tââq pleng, buôn klêêu Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Xong xók hââm pađuôiq kalóóng lóóm karnóq ađêi, Ađó ââi: “Taai hau dhong nooi ađô chêk-tabâân karnal chrih? Lalua, aku praaq palơq nôôq pe, kah ve n'đó karnal chrih e bâân đóng leq dhong nooi ađô …” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Hayơq xók ơi xooq lơơi piđó, mót lóóiq kalóóng bhuông, Ađó vôôiq chaang tóór hót tôôh.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Nôôq môôn-đô havil pei đââng beng, lơq piđó kah rau ve palơq ađêi kalóóng bhuông, chapiên mưi beq beng. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Ađó praaq pahêch piđó kơi ađô: “Phaai chagơn! Phaai hêch leq piêng ưng manưih Pha-ri-si lơq piêng ưng Hê-rôôt.” <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Piđó tapraaq xóng piđó kơi chiên ađô nek taai piđó kah ve beng. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Taai n'nal kơi achêk, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Hau adhi anó vil tarkaai taai chiên adhi anó kah ve beng? Adhi anó dyơq kah chóóm n'nal, lơq kung kah n'nal hơ? Ve lua lóóm adhi anó val xar ka-óng nhâng aq? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Ve mat hơq adhi anó kah lêi hơ? Ve katór hơq adhi anó kah xâng hơ? Adhi anó kung kah hei hơ? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Xók thêi veh xââng beq beng đóng xââng ngaan manưih, adhi anó ơi karong bâân n'đơq jong bing beng lêêk?” Piđó ââi palơq Ađó: “Majêt bơơr jong.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Hayơq bhêêl tapól beq beng đóng puôn ngaan manưih, adhi anó karong bâân n'đơq jong bing beng lêêk?” Piđó ââi palơq Ađó: “Tapól jong.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Lơq Ađó praaq piđó: “Ng'kơi têêng hơq adhi anó dyơq kah n'nal?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Piđó vôôiq tơk Bêêt-saai-đa, lơq palââng đââng tơk đóng Ađó mưi manưih kabaang, hayơq piđó nhan gavơh Ađó buôn Ađó ve chóóm kadhâng leq ađó ađek. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Kadhâng têi manưih kabaang, Ađó chơơng ađó ađek gluh leq nguôi bhươl. Xong xók kathui đơơk havi leq mat ađó, lơơi têi ađêi dhiq ađó, Chuôq tamóh ađó: “Amei ve lêi dhơ dharau kah?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Chaling lêi, ađó ââi: “Aku lêi palââng hơq piđó thê kơi nôôq tââm n'lóóng xók vôôiq.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Tââq ađek, mưi chu dyơq, Chuôq lơơi têi dhiq mat ađó, hayơq ađó ađek lêi mre, mat lêi bâân yươh lơq ađó ve lêi dyóp rau kơi drêh dróói. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Chuôq kayua ađó val chô leq đong ađêi, pató: “Óóq chô mót kalóóng bhươl.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Chuôq Jê-su palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi vôôiq mót leq nôôq bhươl kanóón mađó Xê-xa-rê Phi-liip, lơq dhiq kalơng vôôiq, Ađó tamóh nôôq môôn-đô ađêi, praaq palơq piđó kơi ađô: “Palââng móón thêi nek ngaai?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Hayơq piđó praaq palơq Ađó, móón kơi ađô: “Jang Bap-tiit, sôôq lââng nek ‘Ê-li,’ hayơq sôôq lââng dyơq nek: ‘Mưi kalóóng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih.’” <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Ađó tamóh piđó: “Hayơq adhi anó móón thêi nek ngaai?” Hayơq bhêêl ââi bóóp, Phi-e-rơ ââi palơq Ađó: “Thêi nek Chuôq Paq Manưih.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ađó pahêch piđó kơi piđó kah chóóm praaq palơq ngaai leq Ađó.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Lơq Ađó tââp pachóóm piđó kơi Akóón Manưih phaai đơơp bơk rau ka-ai karuôq, bâân m'peq lơơi taai nôôq takóh bhươl, nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih palơq nôôq thêi pachóóm gani, lơq bâân leng chêt, hayơq mamông lóóiq xong pe tangêi. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ađó ơi móón paraaq ađô kơi drêh dróói. Phi-e-rơ, xong xók đââng Chuôq n'tua dhiq, tââp trêh kajơq Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Bơơi, xók ơi palâh lóóiq lêi nôôq môôn-đô ađêi, Ađó trêh teng Phi-e-rơ kơi ađô: “Sa-taan tôôh, phaai róch xooq hót hóng aku! Taai amei kah lơơi lóóm ađêi kanóq tơk tarnêêng ưng Yaang Pleng, hơq chapiên tơk tarnêêng akóón manưih.” <verse eid="MRK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Xong xók dhaloong tanóói dhanuôr palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “La ngaai kiêng ting tapun aku, manưih ađek phaai m'peq lơơi ađêi kala, đuôl n'lóóng m'baang chatông ađêi lơq ting aku. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ơi la ngaai kiêng paq parmông ađêi, nek e têêng tabil ađó, hayơq manưih đu ơi taai aku lơq Taruuih Liêm e đơơp tabil parmông ađêi, nek e bâân paq ađó. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ơi hau malơơi đóng manưih bâân luch talaang katiêk hơq vil nek bil yaang ravaai ađêi? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Manưih achêk ve chóóm harau pei kơi ve rau raxal palơq yaang ravaai ađêi? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />La ngaai kachiit mat leq Aku lơq paraaq ưng Aku kalóóng dhong nooi tapiing taniêt lơq matu lơt ađô, nek Akóón Manưih kung e kachiit mat leq manưih ađek xók Ađó bhral kalóóng brương cha-iil ưng Ama Ađó nek palơq nôôq dhơn pleng liêm.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Lalua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó kơi ve masôôq manưih xók dyương dhiq ađôk nek nôôq manưih dhơ dhakơi yươq glêh xâng akan chêt laloom xók piđó móng lêi katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng tơk palơq mataai raman.” <verse eid="MRK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Chapat tangêi tatun, Chuôq Jê-su đââng Phi-e-rơ, Ja-kơ lơq Jang hayơq đââng panlei chapiên piđó vôôiq đơk leq mưi pabhung bôôl yaal, lơq Ađó bâân paxar achak toom mat piđó. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Aau Ađó vil xar brương braang bhlơng, bhóók chadhah, tơk mơ kah ngaai manưih thơơq kathel dhiq hóng katiêk ve đuôh têêng đóng bhóók chóóm kơi achêk. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ê-li palơq Môôi-se bâân piđó ve lêi, lơq bơơr nhiđó achêk xók praaq chiên palơq Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Xók lóng paraaq, Phi-e-rơ móón palơq Chuôq Jê-su: “Ra-bi, lalua nek liêm đóng nôôq he tơơt dhiq ađôk, nôôq yi ve chóóm kadhơng pe beq pơơq, mưi đóng thêi, mưi đóng Môôi-se lơq mưi đóng Ê-li.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(Ơi ađó kah n'nal ađó chóóm lóng bóóp praaq harau, taai piđó maar kakhin kapơn.) <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Hayơq mưi garboq dhaluk bhral tơk dhuum piđó, lơq dhariêng praaq gluh tââq garboq dhaluk: “Ađô nek Akóón nh'nhơr bhlơng ưng Aku. Phaai xâng paraaq Akóón ađek.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />N'drươh, xók lêi praang, piđó kah dyơq lêi mak ngaai lââng tơơt palơq ađêi, chapiên mưi Chuôq Jê-su.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Xók piđó vôôiq tââq piing bôôl dhuônh, Ađó pató piđó kơi piđó óóq truuih lóóiq palơq ngaai leq nôôq rau piđó ơi lêi, la kah ơi tơk bhêêl Akóón Manưih tââq akan chêt mamông lóóiq. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Piđó jư lââp paraaq ađek kalóóng m'pơng piđó, tapraaq xóng piđó lêi “tââq akan chêt mamông lóóiq” nek n'đó kơi. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Piđó tamóh palơq Chuôq, móón kơi ađô: “Hau nôôq thêi pachóóm gani praaq nek Ê-li phaai tơk loom?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Hayơq Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Ê-li pâng nek tơk loom buôn hayuur lóóiq dyóp tarnêêng. Kơi achêk nek paraaq bâân xaraq leq Akóón Manưih kơi Ađó phaai đơơp bơk rau janah lơq bâân takađiq nek ng'kơi? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Dhơ kơi ađek, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó kơi Ê-li ơi tơk lalua aq, lơq palââng ơi têêng n'nal đơq rau piđó kiêng palơq ađó, i-kơi paraaq ơi bâân xaraq leq ađó.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Xók tơk dham nôôq môôn-đô đu dyơq, piđó lêi mưi tanóói dhanuôr lóng bơk praang xirvir piđó lơq nôôq thêi pachóóm gani xók tarkaai palơq nôôq môôn-đô achêk. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />N'drươh, xók ơi lêi Ađó, luch tanóói dhanuôr hêq lêi, lơq xong xók mut tơk palơq Ađó, piđó chap yayar Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Ađó tamóh nôôq môôn-đô: “Adhi anó xók tarkaai palơq piđó leq tarnêêng hau?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Mưi nak kalóóng manưih ganơr ââi Ađó: “Thêi ơơi, aku đââng tơk đóng thêi chanak akóón padruuih ưng aku, bâân mưi yaang a-ơp mót bóq. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Hơq n'đó dhiq ađó ve chóóm têêng kala akóón aku, nek ađó dhalươq akóón paniên leq katiêk, hayơq akóón paniên tapô havi tââq bóóp, kakreet kaniêng, lơq próng likrô, aku ơi nhan nôôq môôn-đô thêi buôn piđó viêng pagluh abhưi, hơq piđó kah dyóp karơ.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Xók achêk, xók ââi lóóiq piđó, Ađó praaq: “Dhong nooi kah huuiq tôôh, aku e tơơt palơq nôôq pe đóng tơk n'đó mơ? Aku e đơơp jruôn nôôq pe đóng tơk n'đó mơ? Phaai đââng akóón paniên tơk đóng aku.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Piđó đââng akóón paniên tơk đóng Ađó, lơq xók lêi Ađó, yaang môôp n'drươh têêng paniên yuur tatrươih vaveq, hayơq xók kalơm leq katiêk, paniên pơl-naal, tapô havi bóóp. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Chuôq tamóh ama ưng paniên: “Ơi n'đơq chu tââq xók chiên ađô yuur vaaih palơq ađó?” Akonh ââi: “Tââq xók dyơq paniên. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Abhưi bhiêk đóók dhalươq ađó, xók nek leq óih, xók nek leq đơơk, buôn leng chêt ađó, bơơi la thêi ve đuôh rau chóóm têêng, taai lóóm kayô nôôq yi, nhan thêi jóói nôôq yi.” <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Xók achêk, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “‘La Thêi ve chóóm’ hơ? Dyóp tarnêêng nek ve chóóm nek palơq manưih huuiq.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />N'drươh, xong xók yuur lalơu, akonh ưng akóón paniên ââi: “Aku huuiq! Nhan thêi paq jóói talum kah huuiq ưng aku!” <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Hayơq xók lêi manưih ganơr xók mut tơk dham piđó, Chuôq Jê-su trêh yaang môôp, kayua đóng ađó: “Abhưi a-ơp lơq tung tôôh, aku kayua đóng amei phaai gluh tââq akóón paniên lơq kah ve mơ chóóm bóq leq ađó dyơq.” <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Xong xók lalơu karơ lơq têêng đóng akóón paniên tatrươih karơ bhlơng, ađó gluh xooq lơq akóón paniên val xar thê kơi manưih chêt, tơk mơ bơk ngaai móón kơi ađô: “Akóón paniên chêt aq.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Bơơi xók pei kadhâng têi paniên, Chuôq Jê-su hayuur paniên yuur, lơq akóón paniên yuur dyương. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Xong xók Ađó ơi vôôiq mót leq đong hayơq, nôôq môôn-đô Ađó tamóh panlei Ađó kơi ađô: “Hau nôôq yi kah đuôh viêng pagluh chóóm abhưi achêk?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Ađó ââi palơq piđó: “Rau abhưi ađô, kah ngaai ve chóóm viêng pagluh đuôh la kah tââq rau nhan gavơh lơq rau điêng cha.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Lơq tââq dhiq ađek xooq vôôiq, piđó pagan leq parah Ga-li-lê, hơq Ađó kah kiêng buôn ngaai n'nal, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />ơi Ađó xók pachóóm nôôq môôn-đô ađêi, lơq praaq palơq piđó kơi ađô: “Akóón Manưih ravang bâân pajaau leq têi palââng, piđó e leng chêt Ađó. Xók ơi bâân leng, Ađó e mamông lóóiq tatun pe tangêi.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Bơơi piđó kah n'nal paraaq ađô, lơq kakhin phaai tamóh Ađó.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Piđó vôôiq tơk kanóón Ka-bê-na-um, lơq xók ơi mót kalóóng đong, Ađó tamóh piđó: “Adhi anó biêh tapraaq hau chiên dhiq kalơng vôôiq?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Bơơi piđó parngau, taai piđó ơi tarkaai xóng piđó dhiq kalơng vôôiq lêi ngaai nek gamak tââm. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Lơq xong xók tơơt, Ađó dhaloong majêt bơơr sưưq-đô karong lóóiq lơq praaq palơq piđó: “La ngaai kiêng têêng akoq, manưih ađek phaai nek manưih xariêq kalóóng paluch lơq nek dhơn ratơơq đóng dyóp ngaai.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Pei hayôk mưi akóón paniên, Ađó lơơi akóón paniên tơơt nham m'pơng piđó, hayơq xong xók hayôk akóón paniên dhiq têi, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Manưih đu vơn achak thêi yaauq mưi kalóóng nôôq akóón paniên kơi ađô nek manưih achêk yaauq thêi, lơq la ngaai yaauq thêi nek manưih achêk eh chapiên yaauq thêi, hơq dyơq yaauq Yaang kayua thêi.” <verse eid="MRK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Jang praaq palơq Ađó: “Thêi ơơi, nôôq yi ơi lêi mưi manưih tôôh vơn dhanóók thêi viêng abhưi lơq nôôq yi ơi kajơq manưih achêk lóóiq, ơi manưih achêk kah ting nôôq he.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su ââi: “Óóq kajơq manưih achêk, ơi kah ve ngaai nek manưih vơn dhanóók thêi têêng mataai chrih hayơq ve chóóm dhalam tatun ađek tóh-đua thêi. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Ơi ngaai eh rau nek jơl palơq nôôq he chênh nek makơi lóóm palơq nôôq he. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Ơi manưih đu vơn dhanóók thêi đóng adhi anó mưi choom đơơk taai adhi anó mađó leq Chuôq Paq Manưih, lalua thêi praaq palơq adhi anó kơi manưih ađek dhakơi yươq bil kaliim haanh ađêi. <verse eid="MRK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Hayơq manưih đu têêng lơt matu đóng mưi kalóóng nôôq akóón paniên ađô nek nôôq manưih đu huuiq leq thêi, nek nh'jang palơq manưih achêk, rau liêm lơh nek ađó bâân choq mưi tapal dhơl gamak praang tuôr ađó, hayơq bâân m'peq leq taxiiq. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />La tapaang têi adhi anó ve chóóm têêng đóng adhi anó lơt matu, phaai kut ađó m'peq. Rau liêm lơh đóng adhi anó nek palơq bhrê khuch hơq mót leq đu parmông, dyơq lơh nek ve bơơr tapaang têi hơq phaai vôôiq mót leq bóng óih, kalóóng óih kah ve pat <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />(dhiq bharui bharan piđó ađek kah chêt, lơq óih kah mơ chóóm tapat). <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />La tapaang dyung adhi anó ve chóóm têêng đóng adhi anó lơt matu, phaai kut ađó aq. Rau liêm lơh đóng adhi anó nek palơq dyung khuch hơq mót kalóóng leq parmông, dyơq lơh nek ve bơơr dyung hơq bâân m'peq leq bóng óih <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />(dhiq bharui bharan piđó ađek kah chêt, lơq óih kah mơ chóóm tapat). <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />La mat adhi anó ve chóóm têêng đóng adhi anó lơt matu, phaai bhalok ađó gluh. Rau liêm lơh đóng adhi anó nek palơq mưi mat hơq mót kalóóng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng, dyơq lơh nek ve bơơr mat hơq bâân m'peq leq bóng óih, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />dhiq bharui bharan piđó ađek kah chêt lơq óih kah mơ chóóm tapat. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Ơi dyóp ngaai e bâân tamuôiq palơq óih. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Abhóh nek liêm kre, bơơi la abhóh val xar bil kariêq, adhi anó e marói leq ađó palơq harau jarma jarmat? Adhi anó phaai ve abhóh kalóóng ađêi, lơq mamông liêm kre palơq xóng ađêi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Xong xók yuur dyương, Ađó vôôiq tââq dham ađek tơk parah Ju-đê lơq parah katiêk hót tôôh karuung Jô-đen, hayơq manưih dhanuôr tapajươk xóng piđó tơk palơq Ađó machu dyơq. Ađó vil pachóóm piđó kơi Ađó dyơq biêh têêng. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Xók nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si tơk đan, piđó tamóh Ađó kơi gani ve đóng pheep mưi manưih kayiik talơơi kađiêl kah, buôn klêêu Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Bơơi, buôn ââi lóóiq, Ađó praaq palơq piđó kơi ađô: “Môôi-se ơi pató pachóóm nôôq pe hau rau?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Piđó móón: “Môôi-se đóng pheep manưih kayiik xaraq bha-aar talơơi hayơq buôn kađiêl yuur xooq.” <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Taai rau karđiq lóóm ưng nôôq pe, hayơq ađó pei xaraq rau gani ađek đóng nôôq pe. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Kơi lââng, tââq xók tââp tanââp ưng tarnêêng tavaaih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 10:6">‘Ađó ơi tavaaih piđó, mưi padruuih lơq mưi pađiil.’<verse eid="MRK 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />‘Ơi taai achêk, manưih padruuih e xooq tââq ama lơq amêêq ađêi,<verse eid="MRK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />lơq bơơr nhiđó e bâân xar mưi achak.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:8">Hayơq nek, nhiđó kah dyơq nek bơơr hơq nek mưi achak. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Taai kơi ađek, hau rau hơq Yaang Pleng ơi pajum lóóiq, nek akóón manưih óóq blah palơơi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Xók tơơt kalóóng đong, nôôq môôn-đô vil tamóh Ađó leq tarnêêng ađô. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Ngaai manưih lơơi kađiêl ađêi lơq nhan mưi manưih lââng, nek manưih achêk matu têêng tapiing nek palơq manưih kađiêl. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Lơq la manưih pađiil, xók ơi lơơi kayiik ađêi, pei manưih lââng, nek ađó matu têêng tapiing.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Palââng đââng tơk đóng Ađó nôôq akóón paniên buôn Ađó ve chóóm lơơi têi dhiq piđó, bơơi nôôq môôn-đô teng trêh piđó. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xók bâân lêi rau ađek, Chuôq Jê-su pagrâ lơq praaq palơq piđó: “Phaai lơơi nôôq akóón paniên tơk palơq thêi, lơq óóq kajơq piđó, taai katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng nek leq nôôq ngaai thê kơi piđó. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, ngaai manưih kah pei đơơp katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng kơi mưi akóón paniên, nek manưih achêk dhakơi kah bâân mót kalóóng ađek.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Xong xók hayôk nôôq akóón paniên kalóóng têi ađêi, lơơi têi dhiq piđó, Ađó đóng phươk.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Xók Ađó tââp tanââp vôôiq dhiq kalơng, mưi manưih tôôh mut tơk, lơq xong xók chakoh toom Chuôq, manưih ađek tamóh Ađó: “Ơ Thêi Bhơt Liêm, harau aku kơng têêng buôn aku ve chóóm đơơp rau parmông taluôn luôn?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Hau amei đóók aku nek bhơt liêm? Kah ngaai bhơt liêm chapiên mưi ađó Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Amei ơi n'nal nôôq gani pachóóm: ‘Óóq leng manưih, óóq têêng tapiing, óóq tatông papei, óóq praaq galơơk chachââr, óóq luut laat, phaai bhi chap ama lơq amêêq ađêi’.” <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Bơơi ađó ađek praaq palơq Chuôq: “Thêi ơơi, aku ơi huuiq jư dyóp rau ađek tââq xók paniên ưng aku.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Bơơi xók lêi ađó, Chuôq Jê-su nh'nhơr ađó, lơq Chuôq kayua ađó: “Amei dyơq thiêuq mưi rau; phaai vôôiq, baan luch dyóp rau amei ve, đóng nh'xóóng leq manưih ngeeo, nek amei e ve drươp kavaan tơơt dhiq pleng, lơq tơk nô leq, hơq ting aku.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Bơơi moh mat val xar ranguôq toom paraaq achêk, ađó ađek ka-ai lóóm yuur xooq, ơi ađó biêh xók ve bơk drươp kavaan bhlơng.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Xong xók lêi praang, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq môôn-đô ađêi: “Alua kadhaap n'nal mơ palơq nôôq manưih ve bơk drươp kavaan buôn bâân mót kalóóng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng!” <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Nôôq môôn-đô kadrêq xâng bhlơng leq nôôq paraaq ưng Ađó, bơơi mưi chu dyơq, xók praaq lóóiq, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó kơi ađô: “Nôôq akóón ơơi, alua nek kadhaap n'nal mơ buôn mót kalóóng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Nek palơq akóón kamel mót kalóóng bóng jarum, achêk nek chiên dhê lơh machơng palơq manưih kavaan mót kalóóng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Hayơq piđó chrih xâng bhlơng, móón palơq Ađó: “Kơi achêk nek ngaai ve chóóm bâân paq?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Lêi leq piđó, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Rau kah chóóm têêng palơq akóón manưih, bơơi eh rau palơq Yaang Pleng. Ơi palơq Yaang Pleng, dyóp tarnêêng maar ve chóóm.” <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Phi-e-rơ yuur praaq móón palơq chuôq: “Thêi lêi ađô, nôôq yi ơi lơơi dyóp rau hơq ting thêi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi: “Alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, kah ve ngaai manưih m'peq lơơi đong xaang, adhi anó, mamóóq adhi, ama amêêq, akóón anaaq, katiêk karuung ơi taai thêi lơq Taruuih Liêm, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />hơq kah bâân đơơp lơh hariêng chu xók ađôk kalóóng ganah nil ađô: leq đong xaang, adhi anó, mamóóq adhi, amêêq, akóón, katiêk ruông nek palơq rau kóóp róp, lơq rau parmông taluôn luôn kalóóng klaang kamó đan tơk. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Bơơi bơk manưih laloom e val xar tatun, lơq manưih tatun e dyók laloom.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Xók achêk, piđó xók dhiq kalơng vôôiq đơk tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem, lơq Chuôq Jê-su xók vôôiq laloom piđó. Piđó braaih kapơn, hayơq nôôq manưih vôôiq tapun tatun nek kakhin kapơn. Xong xók đââng majêt bơơr sưưq-đô pantua, Ađó lóóiq tââp praaq palơq piđó leq nôôq tarnêêng ravang vaaih tơk đóng Ađó, <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />kơi ađô: “Lêi ađô, nôôq he xók vôôiq đơk tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem, lơq Akóón Manưih e bâân pajaau đóng nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih lơq nôôq thêi pachóóm gani, hayơq piđó e xêi patu leng chêt Ađó lơq pajaau Ađó leq dhanuôr lââng. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Piđó e ajóóch Ađó, kathui kachoh Ađó, m'bhiiq vuôt Ađó, lơq leng chêt Ađó, bơơi xong pe tangêi Ađó e mamông lóóiq.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Ja-kơ lơq Jang, bơơr akóón padruuih ưng Xê-bê-đê, tơk lum Chuôq, móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi ơơi, nôôq yi đương rââm kơi la mak rau nôôq yi nhan gavơh thêi, thêi e têêng đóng nôôq yi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Hayơq Ađó praaq palơq nhiđó: “Adhi anó kiêng thêi hau têêng đóng adhi anó?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Kơi achêk nek nhiđó ââi palơq Ađó: “Nhan patơơt đóng nôôq yi ng'kơi đóng nôôq yi ve chóóm tơơt kalóóng dham cha-iil tabah ưng thêi, mưi nak hót tươm thêi lơq mưi nak hót ađaai thêi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su ââi nhiđó: “Adhi anó kah n'nal ađêi xók nhan hau rau. Adhi anó ve chóóm ơm choom hơq thêi ơm, môôiq đơơp bap-teem kơi pheep bap-teem hơq thêi đơơp kah?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Nhiđó ââi palơq Ađó: “Nôôq yi ve chóóm.” Hayơq Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq nhiđó: “Choom hơq thêi ơm, adhi anó e ơm, lơq pheep bap-teem hơq thêi đơơp, adhi anó e đơơp. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Bơơi buôn tơơt hót tươm môôiq hót ađaai ưng thêi nek eh taai thêi patơơt, bơơi ravang đóng manưih ơi bâân ravang lơơi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Xók xâng tarnêêng ađô, majêt sưưq-đô tôôh vaaih pagrâ palơq Ja-kơ lơq Jang. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Xong xók dhaloong piđó tơk, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Adhi anó n'nal kơi nôôq manưih bâân padyók têêng kala nôôq dhanuôr lââng nek janah manưih dhanuôr, lơq nôôq manưih ve têêng gamak ưng piđó n'dróh rau kataai pa-eep palââng. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Bơơi tarnêêng eh rau nek kơi achêk m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó. Palâh lóóiq, ngaai manưih kiêng val xar gamak m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó e phaai nek manưih têêng yaauq ưng adhi anó, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />lơq ngaai manưih kiêng nek akoq m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó e phaai nek dhơn xól đóng dyóp ngaai. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Ơi Akóón Manưih patơk mơ ơi eh bhral buôn bâân yaauq, bơơi nek buôn têêng yaauq lơq pajaau parhââm mamông ađêi têêng janaaq pók klóóih đóng bơk manưih.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Piđó vôôiq mót kanóón Jê-ri-kô, lơq xók Ađó vôôiq xooq tââq Jê-ri-kô palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi lơq tanóói dhanuôr bơk, nek Ba-ti-mê, akóón padruuih ưng Ti-mê, nek mưi manưih nhanhan kabaang xók tơơt tóór kalơng. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Xók xâng n'nal kơi ađek nek Chuôq Jê-su manưih Na-xa-reet, ađó yuur lalơu karơ lơq praaq: “Jê-su ơơi, Akóón bhua Đa-viit, nhan kayô ka-er aku!” <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bơk manưih trêh teng ađó ađô buôn ađó parngau, bơơi ađó lalơu karơ bhlơng lơh dyơq: “Akóón bhua Đa-viit, nhan kayô ka-er aku!” <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Xong xók katơng parngau, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Phaai dhaloong ađó achêk.” Hayơq piđó dhaloong manưih kabaang achêk, móón ađó: “Phaai mưng lóóm! Yuur dyương aq! Thêi xók dhaloong amei.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Hayơq xók m'peq aau chaguôk ađêi leq mưi hót, yuur dyương pađâh, ađó tơk palơq Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Ââi palơq ađó, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Amei kiêng aku hau têêng đóng amei?” Kơi achêk nek manưih kabaang ââi palơq Chuôq: “Ra-bi, ađek nek ng'kơi aku ve chóóm bâân lêi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Kơi achêk nek Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Phaai vôôiq. Lóóm huuiq ưng amei ơi payươh đóng amei.” N'drươh, ađó bâân chóóm lêi hayơq ađó vôôiq ting Chuôq dhiq kalơng.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Xók piđó vôôiq đan tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem, tơk Bê-pha-jê lơq Bê-tha-ni, malóóm leq bôôl Ô-liiu, Ađó kayua bơơr môôn-đô ưng ađêi vôôiq, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />lơq praaq palơq nhiđó: “Phaai vôôiq mót leq bhươl toom mat adhi anó, dhalam xók mót tơk ađek, adhi anó e lêi mưi axeh akóón bâân tachoq, kah glêh ve ngaai dhââng dhiq ađó. Phaai lêh tarlêi choq đóng ađó lơq đââng ađó chô leq ađô. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />La ngaai ađek tamóh adhi anó: ‘Hau anhưa têêng kơi ađek?’ nek phaai ââi kơi ađô: ‘Chuôq ve kiêng đươi ađó lơq Chuôq e pachô taval ađó lóóiq.’” <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Nhiđó yuur vôôiq lơq lêi mưi axeh akóón bâân tachoq dhalam palóng nguôi hót kalơng, hayơq nhiđó lêh tarlêi đóng ađó. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Masôôq manưih dyương dhiq ađek móón palơq nhiđó: “Bơơr anhưa hau têêng hơq lêh tarlêi choq axeh akóón ađek?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Nhiđó ââi lóóiq nôôq manưih ađek kơi Chuôq Jê-su ơi pató, lơq nôôq manưih ađek lơơi đóng nhiđó vôôiq. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Nhiđó đââng axeh akóón chô đóng Chuôq Jê-su hayơq bhalêêp aau chaguôk ađêi dhiq axeh, lơq Chuôq tơơt leq ađek. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Bơk manưih yuur bhalêêp aau piđó dhiq kalơng, hayơq palơq nôôq lââng, nek bhalêêp nôôq đóóng n'lóóng ơi têch tââq klung. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Tabhơt nôôq manưih vôôiq laloom palơq nôôq manưih ting tapun driêu karơ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hô-sa-na! Đaang bhi haanh Yaang vơn dhanóók Chuôq jaq bhral.<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Phươk đóng katiêk e tơk ưng abhươp avuôq Đa-viit nôôq he! Hô-sa-na kalóóng dhiq bhơt yaal!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Ađó ơi vôôiq mót kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem, mót kalóóng đong bhanuôih, lơq xók ơi lêi praang xirvir dyóp rau, taai xók achêk kung gling kanam hayơq, Ađó yuur vôôiq tơk Bê-tha-ni palơq majêt bơơr sưưq-đô. <verse eid="MRK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Tangêi rayiiu, xók piđó ơi yuur vôôiq tââq Bê-tha-ni, nek Ađó ha-ul. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Xók chalaang lêi mưi tââm tarung ve bơk axơq tââq changaai, Ađó tơk, kah machưng Ađó e bâân lêi ve n'đó pale dhiq n'lóóng nh'jau. Hơq xók ơi tơk dham n'lóóng achêk, Ađó kah lêi ve rau chapiên axơq, ơi eh rau nek nil tarung. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Lơơi lóóiq chiên ađô, Ađó praaq palơq n'lóóng ađek: “E kah ve mơ dyơq ngaai cha pale tââq dham ưng amei dyơq.” Nôôq môôn-đô Ađó xâng paraaq ađek.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Xók vôôiq tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem, lơq mót kalóóng đong bhanuôih, Ađó tââp tanââp viêng manưih baan manưih kơl kalóóng đong bhanuôih gluh leq nguôi, Ađó talâh n'toh baang ưng nôôq manưih raxal jêên lơq tanơơt ưng nôôq manưih baan paraap. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Ađó kah đóng pheep dhơ dhangaai đââng đô-đaak vôôiq val dhiq đong bhanuôih. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Hayơq Ađó pachóóm piđó lơq praaq: “Eh alua ve paraaq xaraq kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">‘Đong aku e bâân đóók nek đong nhan gavơh đóng dyóp dhanuôr’ hơ?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 11:17">Bơơi nôôq pe ơi paxar ađó xar bóng gơơp ưng kabhuh tatông.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih lơq thêi pachóóm gani xâng kơi achêk, nek piđó tabâân kơi piđó ve chóóm leng Ađó, taai piđó kakhin Ađó, ơi luch tanóói dhanuôr maar chrih xâng leq rau pachóóm ưng Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Tơk xók habu blót, piđó xooq tââq kanóón.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Leq vaar yayóng, xók vôôiq lalơh, piđó lêi n'lóóng tarung ơi rang xeu tââq tââm riêh. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Xong xók hei lóóiq, Phi-e-rơ móón palơq Ađó: “Ra-bi, lêi tôôh! N'lóóng tarung hơq thêi tóh ơi rang xeu aq.” <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Xók ââi lóóiq, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Phaai ve lóóm huuiq dhiq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, kơi ngaai manưih praaq palơq bôôl ađô: ‘Phaai tandrôôq lơq choh leq taxiiq,’ hơq yươq paang-ra kalóóng lóóm ađêi, bơơi huuiq kơi rau ađêi praaq ravang vaaih, nek tarnêêng e vaaih đóng manưih ađek. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Taai kơi achêk, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, tabhơt dyóp rau adhi anó gavơh nhan lơq mââl nhan, phaai huuiq kơi adhi anó ơi bâân đơơp, nek rau ađek e vaaih đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Xók adhi anó dyương gavơh nhan, la adhi anó ve chiên tajơl palơq ngaai ađek, nek phaai lơơi lơt, buôn Ama ưng adhi anó nek Yaang tơơt dhiq pleng kung lơơi lơt adhi anó leq nôôq têêng lơt ưng adhi anó.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />(Bơơi la adhi anó kah lơơi lơt, nek Ama ưng adhi anó nek Yaang tơơt dhiq pleng kung e kah lơơi lơt nôôq têêng lơt ưng adhi anó)<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Hayơq piđó vil vôôiq tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem lơq xók Ađó xók vôôiq kalóóng đong bhanuôih, nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih, nôôq thêi pachóóm gani, lơq nôôq takóh bhươl tơk palơq Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Piđó praaq palơq Ađó: “N'đó tââq mataai karơ hơq amei têêng nôôq tarnêêng achêk lơq ngaai ơi pajaau đóng amei mataai karơ ađô buôn amei ve chóóm têêng nôôq rau ađek?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Aku kung e tamóh nôôq pe mưi xayar, lơq phaai ââi aku, hayơq aku e móón đóng nôôq pe n'đó tââq mataai karơ hơq aku têêng nôôq tarnêêng ađek. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Pheep bap-teem ưng Jang nek tââq pleng môôiq tââq akóón manưih? Phaai ââi aku.” <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Piđó tapraaq palơq xóng piđó kơi ađô: “Nôôq he móón ng'kơi? La nôôq he móón: ‘Tââq pleng’ manưih ađô e praaq: ‘kơi achêk nek, ơi taai hau hơq nôôq pe kah huuiq Jang?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Palâh lóóiq, la nôôq he móón: ‘Tââq akóón manưih’, …?” (Nôôq piđó kakhin manưih dhanuôr, ơi dyóp ngaai kung lêi kơi Jang lalua nek mưi manưih đââng paraaq Yaang Pleng.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Hayơq xók ââi Chuôq Jê-su, piđó ââi: “Nôôq yi kah n'nal.” Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Aku kung kah móón palơq nôôq pe n'đó tââq mataai karơ hơq aku têêng nôôq tarnêêng achêk.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Ađó tââp praaq palơq piđó palơq babi: “Mưi manưih tôôh choh bhươn nho, gróóng garóóng praang xirvir, uôch bóng galiq buôh, têêng mưi móóng đương jư, lơq đóng nôôq manưih choh nho muôt lóóiq bhươn, hayơq yuur vôôiq leq changaai. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Tơk nil leh pale, ađó kayua mưi dhơn ratơơq tơk palơq kabhuh choh nho buôn tââq nôôq manưih ađô, ađó ve chóóm đơơp mưi phơn yưưm malơơi ưng bhươn. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Hơq xong xók kóóp kadhâng ađó ađek, nôôq piđó m'bhiiq m'bhah hayơq viêng chô têi kagóh. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Ađó vil kayua mưi dhơn ratơơq đu lââng tơk palơq nôôq piđó, lơq palơq manưih ađek, piđó m'bhiiq leq akoq lơq tóh taaiq ađó. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Hayơq ađó kayua dhơn ratơơq lââng dyơq, palơq ađó achêk, nôôq piđó leng chêt, lơq palơq bơk manưih lââng — bhêêl m'bhiiq m'pah manưih ađô, xók leng chêt manưih tôôh. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Ađó ve mưi nak dyơq, nek akóón padruuih nh'nhơr bhlơng, ađó kayua ađó achêk, manưih tatun kiêt, tơk palơq nôôq piđó, kanóq kơi ađô: ‘Nôôq piđó e bhi chap akóón padruuih ađêi.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Bơơi kabhuh choh nho ađek tapraaq palơq xóng piđó kơi ađô: ‘Ađôk nek akóón đơơp karvaan. Hêq vôôiq, nôôq he phaai leng ađó, hayơq drươp karvaan e nek ưng nôôq he.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Kơi achêk nek xong xók kóóp jư, kabhuh piđó leng akóón padruuih achêk, hayơq m'peq ađó pagluh leq nguôi bhươn nho. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Kơi achêk hayơq, kala bhươn nho e hau têêng? Ađó e tơk leng kaxiêt kabhuh choh nho lơq pajaau bhươn nho đóng nôôq manưih lââng. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Nôôq pe kah glêh đok paraaq ađô kalóóng Bha-aar Yaang Pleng hơ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Kaliêng dhơl hơq thơơq têêng đong m'peq lơơi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">dhơl ađek ơi bâân val xar dhơl n'tól đong.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Tarnêêng ađô tơk tââq Chuôq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">lơq achêk nek tarnêêng mataai chrih kalóóng mat nôôq he.’”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Kơi achêk nek piđó tabâân kơi kóóp Ađó hơq piđó kakhin manưih dhanuôr, ơi piđó n'nal kơi Ađó truuih babi ađek galeeng leq piđó. Hayơq xók xooq tââq Ađó, piđó yuur vôôiq.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Hayơq piđó kayua nôôq manưih mađó kabhuh Pha-ri-si lơq mađó kabhuh Hê-rôôt tơk palơq Ađó buôn kabhuh piđó paxruuk Chuôq kalóóng bóóp praaq. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Xók tơk, piđó móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi ơơi, nôôq yi n'nal kơi thêi nek manưih dhalam tapat lơq dhiq thêi, kah ve chiên patui ting dhơ dhangaai, taai thêi yươq lêi leq hót nguôi ưng palââng, klóóih leq ađek, thêi pachóóm pató kalơng ưng Yaang Pleng pâng ting paraaq dhalam. Ve pâng gani môôiq kah xók pagoop jêên đóng Sê-sa? Nôôq he chóóm pagoop môôiq kah chóóm pagoop?” <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Bơơi taai n'nal keen paliêm bóóp hót nguôi ưng piđó, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Hau nôôq pe vil klêêu aku? Phaai đââng đóng aku mưi đơ-ni-ê buôn aku lêi.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Kơi achêk nek piđó đââng tơk mưi đông jêên. Hayơq Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “A-ô lơq dhanóók achak ađô nek ưng ngaai?” Piđó ââi palơq Ađó: “Ưng Sê-sa.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Xók achêk, Chuôq Jê-su praaq kayua piđó: “Phaai pachô đóng Sê-sa rau dhơơm ưng Sê-sa, lơq pachô đóng Yaang Pleng rau dhơơm ưng Yaang Pleng.” Piđó maar hêq lêi toom Ađó.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Hayơq kabhuh manưih Sa-đu-sê, nek nôôq manưih praaq kơi kah ve rau mamông lóóiq, tơk palơq Ađó lơq tamóh Ađó, kơi ađô: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Thêi ơơi, Môôi-se ơi xaraq đóng nôôq he kơi ađô: ‘La anó ưng mưi ngaai ađek chêt lơơi lóóiq kađiêl hơq kah ơi ve akóón, nek adhi ưng manưih anó phaai pei manưih kađiêl achêk lơq patet dhong nooi đóng anó ađêi.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Ve tapól adhi anó achêk, manưih anó taha pei kađiêl hayơq chêt, kah ve akóón. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Manưih tadhi đu bơơr pei pađiil achêk, hayơq chêt, kah ve akóón, lơq manưih đu pe kung kơi achêk. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Luch tapól chanak maar kah ve akóón. Patơk xariêq, manưih pađiil kung chêt. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Tơk bhêêl mamông lóóiq, xók piđó mamông lóóiq, pađiil tôôh e nek kađiêl ưng ngaai kalóóng nôôq piđó? Taai tapól nak maar ơi pei pađiil achêk têêng kađiêl.” <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Kah alua nôôq pe bâân kađââng vôôiq xraang lơt taai rau ađô hơ, taai kah n'nal Bha-aar Yaang Pleng kung kơi mataai karơ ưng Yaang Pleng? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ơi xók palââng tââq akan chêt mamông lóóiq, palââng kah pei môôiq đơơp, bơơi piđó e thê kơi nôôq dhơn pleng dhiq pleng. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Hayơq leq tarnêêng manưih chêt bâân mamông lóóiq, ve kơq nôôq pe kah ơi đok kalóóng bha-aar ưng Môôi-se, dhiq phơn xaraq truuih leq tââm xông, ng'kơi hơq Yaang Pleng praaq palơq ađó kơi ađô: ‘Aku nek Yaang Pleng ưng Ap-ra-haam, Yaang Pleng ưng I-saak, lơq Yaang Pleng ưng Ja-kôôp’? <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Ađó eh rau nek Yaang Pleng ưng manưih chêt, hơq nek ưng manưih mamông. Nôôq pe xók ađôk bâân lơt lóng gamak.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Xók mưi kalóóng nôôq thêi pachóóm gani ơi tơk đan, bâân xâng piđó xók tarkaai xóng piđó, lêi kơi Ađó ââi nôôq manưih tôôh lóng parhei, nek ađó tamóh Chuôq: “N'đó nek gani pachóóm kiiq tââm kalóóng tabhơt gani?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi kơi ađô: “Gani pachóóm kiiq tââm nek: ‘I-sơ-ra-êên ơơi, phaai xâng ađô, Chuôq, Yaang Pleng nôôq he, nek Chuôq mưi giêl <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Akóón phaai nh'nhơr chap Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng ưng akóón palơq pabhơt kalóóng lóóm ađêi, palơq pabhơt yaang ravaai ađêi, palơq pabhơt karnóq ađêi, lơq palơq pabhơt praan karơ ađêi.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Gani pachóóm đu bơơr nek ađôk: ‘Akóón phaai nh'nhơr manưih đan griêq ưng akóón kơi achak ađêi.’ Kah ve gani pachóóm đu lââng gamak lơh bơơr rau ađô.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Thêi pachóóm gani praaq palơq Chuôq: “Dhalam bhlơng, thêi ơơi! Thêi ơi praaq ting paraaq dhalam kơi Ađó nek mưi giêl, lơq kah ve chuôq đu lââng nguôi Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Bhi nh'nhơr Ađó palơq bhơt luônh lóóm, palơq tabhơt tarbech n'nal, nek palơq tabhơt praan karơ, lơq tanhơr manưih đan griêq kơi chênh ađêi patơk mơ ve liêm lơh dyóp bhanuôih boh bhơt lơq adhah bhuôih.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Xong xók lêi ađó, taai ađó ơi ââi lóóiq kơi tarbech galang, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Amei yươq rau changaai tââq katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng.” Lơq kah ngaai hayơq khin tamóh Ađó dyơq.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Buôn ââi lóóiq, xók bhêêl truuih pachóóm kalóóng taang đong bhanuôih, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “N'đó kơi dhơq nôôq thêi pachóóm gani móón kơi Chuôq Paq Manưih nek akóón bhua Đa-viit? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Chênh bhua Đa-viit, kalóóng Chuôq Yaang Liêm, ơi praaq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Chuôq praaq palơq Chuôq aku:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">“phaai tơơt hót atươm Aku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">đóng tơk n'đó xók Aku patơơt nôôq manưih brau Akóón raal dyung ưng Akóón.”’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Chênh Đa-viit đóók Ađó nek ‘Chuôq,’ nek ng'kơi Ađó nek akóón ưng bhua chêk chóóm?” Tanóói dhanuôr bơk tameng xâng Ađó kơi bhuui lóóm.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Kalóóng rau truuih pachóóm ưng ađêi, Ađó praaq: “Phaai hêch palơq nôôq thêi pachóóm gani, nek nôôq manưih malóóch kiêng vôôiq dyương kalóóng kun aau yaal, nôôq paraaq yayar tamóh m'pơng chơơq, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />dham tơơt dhiq tarhơơnh kalóóng đong gươl palơq dham hót malo dhiq bhiêk bhaan. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Nôôq manưih ađek lâân đong ưng pađiil kamaai, têêng pathê nhan gavơh pađươnh. Nôôq manưih ađô e đơơp bha-aar xêi matu haleng lơh.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Hayơq xók ơi tơơt chaang-gan dham lơơi hôk kađôôq jêên ưng đong bhanuôih, Ađó chamet lêi manưih dhanuôr chrooq jêên leq hôk n'đó kơi. Bơk manưih kavaan tuul chrooq nôôq jêên gamak. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Xók mưi pađiil kamaai ngeeo vôôiq tơk, amooq chrooq tuul bơơr đông jêên katưưiq, janaaq kiêng mađơq nek mưi xu. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Xong xók dhaloong nôôq môôn-đô ưng ađêi lóóiq, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó kơi pađiil kamaai ngeeo ađô ơi tapôông bơk lơh tabhơt nôôq manưih ơi chrooq jêên leq hôk tôôh. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Ơi tabhơt piđó maar tapôông tââq rau xưa raai ưng ađêi, bơơi amooq achêk, tââq kalóóng rau ngeeo kadhaap, ưng ađêi, ơi tapôông luch tabhơt amooq ve, hơq dyóp rau koom lơơi buôn ban mamông ađêi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Xók bhêêl Ađó xooq tââq đong bhanuôih, mưi kalóóng nôôq môôn-đô Ađó móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi ơơi, lêi tôôh! Nôôq bhangôh dhơl pơq gamak n'nal mơ lơq nôôq tarnêêng liêm kre n'nal đơq!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq môôn-đô achêk: “Amei lêi nôôq dhanong đong mangi magrauq ađô kah? E kah dyơq talơơi mưi n'đó bhangôh dhơl tơơt dhiq ađôk bâân lơơi tagơơn dhiq bhangôh dhơl lââng hơq dhơl achêk e yươq bâân pahư halơm.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Lơq xók bhêêl Ađó tơơt dhiq bôôl Ô-liiu chaang-gan đong bhanuôih, Phi-e-rơ, Ja-kơ, Jang lơq En-rê tamóh pantua Ađó: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Nhan thêi praaq đóng nôôq yi, n'đó bhêêl nôôq tarnêêng achêk e yuur vaaih? Lơq ve kanal harau xók dyóp rau ađek ravang bâân tarjaap?” <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Xók achêk, Chuôq Jê-su gluh paraaq praaq palơq piđó: “Phaai chagơn, óóq buôn ngaai kađââng chơơng adhi anó vôôiq lơt xraang. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Bơk manưih e tơk vơn dhanóók thêi, praaq kơi ađô: ‘Nek aku ađôk,’ lơq piđó e kađââng chơơng bơk manưih vôôiq lơt xraang. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Hayơq xók adhi anó xâng leq tarvei taleng lơq taruuih tanđôôr leq tarvei taleng, nek óóq karaang kakhin; rau ađek phaai yuur vaaih, bơơi eh rau nek tatun xariêq. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Ơi dhanuôr ađô e yuur dyương jaklâk lóóiq dhanuôr lââng, lơq katiêk ađô jaklâk lóóiq katiêk tôôh. E ve dha-ơr katiêk dhiq bơk dham, e ve bơk ganah ha-ul. Bơơi tarnêêng ađek nek tââp tarnââp ưng nôôq bhêêl ka-ai ayaai.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Mat lââng, chênh adhi anó phaai hêch lêi. Palââng e pajaau adhi anó đóng kabhuh xêi xanêi lơq đóng leq đong gươl, adhi anó e bâân vei m'bhiiq, e dyương toom kabhuh têêng gamak lơq nôôq bhua ơi taai thêi, kơi mưi paraaq truuih đuui đóng piđó. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Lơq laloom tââm, Taruuih Liêm phaai bâân truuih pachóóm đóng dyóp dhanuôr manưih. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Xók palââng kóóp đââng adhi anó vôôiq pajaau, óóq karaang leq paraaq ađêi phaai praaq. Dhơ kơi ađek, la n'đó paraaq bâân đóng leq adhi anó kalóóng bhêêl ađek, nek phaai praaq paraaq achêk; ơi adhi anó eh rau nek manưih xók praaq, bơơi nek Chuôq Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Anó e pajaau adhi leq dham chêt, ama nek pajaau akóón. Hayơq akóón anaaq e yuur vaaih jaklâk tajơl ama amêêq lơq têêng piđó bâân leng chêt. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Adhi anó e bâân dyóp ngaai gaam geet taai dhanóók ưng thêi. Bơơi ngaai mưng lóóm đóng tơk tatun xariêq, manưih ađek e bâân paq.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Mat lââng, xók adhi anó lêi rau harek haper ưng tarlum bhahi bhatoong ve mat dhiq dham kah chóóm ve (manưih đok phaai n'nal), nek nôôq ngaai tơơt dhiq xưưq Ju-đê phaai mut klôôn leq bôôl, <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />hayơq ngaai tơơt dhiq pabhung đong, óóq dhaluônh kung óóq mót kalóóng buôn pei dhơ dharau gluq tââq đong ađêi, <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />lơq ngaai tơơt dhiq klung, óóq palâh val chô palơq nôôq rau dyơq hót hóng buôn pei aau chaguôk ưng ađêi. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Bơơi ayô xarngaat đóng pađiil xók ve đađââng lơq pađiil đóng akóón mam kalóóng nôôq tangêi achêk! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Palâh lóóiq, phaai nhan gavơh buôn tarnêêng ađek yươq yuur vaaih leq nil khau. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Ơi kalóóng nôôq tangêi ađek e ve bhrê hư tơk meen kah glêh ve kơi achêk tư tââq tââp tarnââp tavaaih, nek xók Yaang Pleng tavaaih dyóp rau đóng tơk ađô, lơq kung e kah chóóm mơ ve lóóiq. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Lơq la Chuôq kah karóch pa-êêp nôôq tangêi achêk, dyóp rau ve parhââm e kah bâân paq. Bơơi ơi taai nôôq manưih bâân chââih, nek nôôq manưih Ađó ơi chââih, Ađó kut paxruiq sôôq tangêi ađek. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Bhêêl achêk, la ve ngaai praaq palơq adhi anó: ‘Lêi ađô, Chuôq Paq Manưih dhiq ađô! Lêi tôôh, dhiq hót tôôh!’ nek óóq huuiq. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Ơi chuôq paq manưih chachââr lơq manưih đââng taruuih chachââr e bâân yuur vaaih, hayơq e yuur pakah nôôq kanal tame lơq mataai chrih buôn, la ve chóóm, têêng đóng lơt xraang nôôq manưih bâân chââih. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Bơơi adhi anó phaai hêch lêi! Phaai lêi ađô, thêi ơi đóng adhi anó n'nal loom dyóp tarnêêng aq.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Dhơ kơi ađek, mót nôôq tangêi achêk, xong đu bhrê hư ađek,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 13:24">mat tangêi nek kanam kanheet,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 13:24">mat bharương e kah pakah kalaaq brương dhiq ađó;<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />nôôq xatur xamenh e tââq pleng n'tôq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 13:25">lơq nôôq praan karơ dhiq pleng e bâân dha-ơr dhakơp.<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Bhêêl xók achêk, palââng e lêi Akóón Manưih palơq mataai raman lơq cha-iil tabah gamak bhlơng jaq tơk m'pơng nôôq garboq dhaluk. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Tatun ađek, Ađó e kayua nôôq dhơn pleng lơq Ađó e panhoom karong lóóiq nôôq manưih bâân chââih ưng Ađó plok puôn charhóóng, tââq xariêq katiêk đóng patơk parluch pleng.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Mat lââng, phaai hok n'nal babi tââq n'lóóng tarung. Xók đóóng ađó val xar ramaanh lơq chamat xơq aq, adhi anó n'nal kơi nil hapaang ơi đan. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Kung kơi achêk, xók adhi anó lêi nôôq tarnêêng ađek yuur vaaih, adhi anó n'nal kơi Ađó xók tơơt đan, pa-ô toom palóng. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó kơi klaang đơơi ađôk dhakơi e yươq lơh bil đóng patơk bhêêl dyóp tarnêêng achêk yuur vaaih. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Pleng lơq katiêk e lơh bil, bơơi nôôq paraaq ưng Thêi dhakơi e yươq lơh bil. <verse eid="MRK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Hayơq leq tangêi ađek môôiq bhêêl ađek, chapiên Ama, nek kah ngaai bâân n'nal, patơk mơ nôôq dhơn pleng dhiq pleng kung kah, lơq Akóón kung kơi achêk.<verse eid="MRK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Phaai hêch lêi! Phaai meh lóóm lơq nhan gavơh, taai adhi anó kah n'nal xók bhêêl ađek nek nh'xók. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Thê kơi mưi manưih tôôh yuur vôôiq changaai đong, xók ơi vôôiq tââq đong ađêi, lơq ơi pajaau đóng dyóp dhơn ratơơq ađêi kataai jư lêi tarnêêng ưng ađêi, nek ađó pató manưih jư palóng kơi ađó achêk phaai đương meh. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Taai ađek, phaai meh lóóm, taai adhi anó kah n'nal n'đó xók kala đong chô tơk — môôiq leq habu hayum, môôiq bhêêl m'pơng hayum; môôiq xók atưưch takar môôiq leq yayóng yayương; <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />e kơi xong xók parmat chô tơk, kala bâân lum adhi anó xók bêch. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Bơơi rau hơq thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, thêi kung praaq palơq dyóp ngaai: ‘Phaai meh lóóm!’”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Xók achêk, xong bơơr tangêi dyơq nek bhiêk Jalơh lơq bhiêk Beng Kah Ve Piêng, nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih palơq thêi pachóóm gani xók tabâân n'đó kơi, buôn xong xók kóóp jư Ađó kơi lalââp, piđó ve chóóm leng Ađó vaq. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ơi piđó praaq: “Kah chóóm têêng kalóóng tangêi bhiêk, kakhin nhôôn nhaauq e yuur vaaih kalóóng manưih dhanuôr.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Xók bhêêl Chuôq tơơt dhiq Bê-tha-ni, kalóóng đong ưng Si-môôn, manưih ka-ai tơơt bhơơi, Ađó xók tơơt dhiq baang chacha nek mưi pađiil vôôiq tơk, đââng katiêu m'beq klóng dhơu lơq ngok kađôôq dhơu kaam tung yươq taklaai, lóng mat jêên. Xong xók m'poh bhriq m'beq klóng, pađiil haling dhơu ađek leq akoq Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bơơi m'pơng kalóóng piđó, ve masôôq manưih vaaih pagrâ: “Ơi ng'hau hơq ve chiên ramuôh pahư dhơu thum ađô? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Taai dhơu ađô ve chóóm baan bâân lơh pe hariêng đơ-ni-ê hayơq đóng nh'xóóng leq manưih ngeeo.” Piđó trêh teng pađiil. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Phaai lơơi pađiil achêk tem. Hau adhi anó têêng pagei pađiil achêk? Ađó ơi yuur têêng mưi tarnêêng liêm đóng thêi. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Ơi adhi anó taluôn ve manưih ngeeo tơơt palơq ađêi, lơq dhơ dhaxók adhi anó kiêng adhi anó ve chóóm têêng tarnêêng liêm đóng piđó, bơơi adhi anó e kah ve thêi taluôn. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Ađó ơi têêng tarnêêng hơq ađó ve chóóm. Ađó ơi ravang laloom buôn xut xaak thêi leq tơk tarnêêng tơp buur. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, dhơ dharau Taruuih Liêm bâân truuih pachóóm n'đó dhiq leq plok hóng katiêk nek tarnêêng hơq pađiil ađô ơi têêng kung e bâân truuih lóóiq kalóóng rau hei tơk leq ađó.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Hayơq Ju-đa Ich-ka-ri-ôôt, mưi kalóóng majêt bơơr sưưq-đô, yuur vôôiq tơk palơq nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih buôn ađó ve chóóm pajaau Chuôq leq piđó. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Xók achêk, xong xók xâng kơi achêk, piđó lóng yayar lơq hươq đóng ađó baak. Hayơq ađó tabâân ng'kơi đu kre buôn tamôôp pajaau Chuôq.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Leq tangêi đu tarnââp ưng bhiêk Beng Kah Ve Piêng, xók palââng tapôông bhanuôih adhah trưưu akóón bhiêk Jalơh, nôôq môôn-đô Ađó praaq palơq Ađó: “Thêi kiêng nôôq yi vôôiq ravang n'đó dhiq đóng thêi ve chóóm cha bhiêk Jalơh?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Hayơq Ađó kayua bơơr kalóóng nôôq môôn-đô ađêi, lơq praaq palơq nhiđó: “Phaai vôôiq mót kalóóng kanóón, lơq mưi manưih kadyaaq angóók đơơk e lum adhi anó. Phaai vôôiq ting ađó ađek. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />La ađó ađek mót n'đó đong, phaai praaq palơq kala đong kơi ađô: ‘Thêi kayua: “Buông tamóói ưng aku, dhiq aku ve chóóm cha bhiêk Jalơh palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi, tơơt n'đó dhiq?”’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Kala đong e chaleq adhi anó mưi beq buông gamak dhiq gaak ơi bâân rapaq ravang lơơi, lơq phaai ravang đóng nôôq yi dhiq ađek.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Kơi achêk nek nôôq môôn-đô yuur vôôiq lơq vôôiq mót leq kanóón, hayơq piđó lêi dyóp tarnêêng i-kơi Ađó ơi praaq palơq piđó, lơq piđó ravang vaar cha bhiêk Jalơh.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Xók ơi tơk habu blót, Ađó vôôiq tơk nek palơq majêt bơơr sưưq-đô. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Xók piđó tơơt tóór baang cha lơq chacha vaar, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó kơi mưi chanak kalóóng adhi anó, nek manưih xók cha palơq thêi, e tamôôp thêi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Piđó tââp ranguôq lóóm lơq manưih ađô tơk manưih tôôh tamóh palơq Ađó: “Dhakơi eh rau nek aku alua?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Bơơi Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Ađek nek mưi kalóóng majêt bơơr adhi anó, manưih xók tươm beng leq choom nek palơq thêi. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Ơi Akóón Manưih e vôôiq dhalam kơi paraaq ơi bâân xaraq leq Ađó, bơơi đaang ngi tóh đóng manưih hơq taai ađó, Akóón Manưih bâân tamôôp pajaau! Nh'jang ađó ađek óóq yuur vaaih nek kre lơh đóng ađó.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Xók dyơq piđó chacha, xong xók pei beng, ma-ơ, Ađó pei veh, pađơơp leq piđó lơq praaq: “Phaai pei đơơp. Ađô nek achak araang ưng thêi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Lơq xong xók pei choom, ma-ơ, Ađó pađơơp leq piđó, lơq piđó maar ơm dhiq choom achêk. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Ađô nek ahaam raket bóóp ưng thêi, nek ahaam bâân n'toh đóng bơk manưih. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Alua, thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, kơi thêi dhơ dhakơi kah dyơq ơm đơơk tââq pale ưng n'lóóng nho dyơq đóng tơk tangêi ađek, nek xók thêi ơm đơơk nho tame kalóóng katiêk Yaang Pleng.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Xong xók babóóch mưi guôp haanh Yaang Pleng, piđó yuur vôôiq malóóm tơk bôôl Ô-liiu. <verse eid="MRK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó kơi ađô: “Tabhơt adhi anó e n'đóih kalơm, kơi ve xaraq kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Aku e m'bhiiq manưih jư,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">nek trưưu e bâân xooq xraang.’<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Bơơi xong xók thêi ơi bâân têêng đóng mamông lóóiq, thêi e vôôiq laloom adhi anó tơk Ga-li-lê.” <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Bơơi Phi-e-rơ móón palơq Ađó: “Patơk mơ dhơ dyóp ngaai e bâân n'đóih kalơm, bơơi aku nek kah mơ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Alua, thêi móón amei, kơi tangêi ađôk — dhalam hayum ađôk — laloom xók atưưch gôông takar bơơr guôp, amei e dyiin thêi pe chu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Bơơi ađó móón kơi parâng: “La pa-eep aku chêt nek palơq thêi, aku dhakơi e kah dyiin thêi.” Xók achêk, tabhơt piđó kung maar móón kơi achêk.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Hayơq piđó vôôiq tơk mưi dhiq, achak dham ađek nek Gêêt-sê-ma-nê, lơq Ađó praaq palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi: “Phaai tơơt dhiq ađôk xók bhêêl thêi nhan gavơh.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Ađó đââng Phi-e-rơ, Ja-kơ, lơq Jang ting vôôiq palơq Ađó, hayơq Ađó tââp vaaih ranguôq karnóq lơq pabhlơng nhok nhói. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Yaang ravaai ưng thêi xók ranguôq bhlơng, patơk mơ chêt vaq. Phaai bhiêk tơơt dhiq ađôk lơq meh lóóm.” <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Hayơq vôôiq changaai kơơq lơh m'bưưiq, Ađó gim mat leq katiêk lơq nhan gavơh kơi, la ve chóóm đuôh, nhan bhêêl ađek lơh tââq Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Ađó móón: “A-ba, Ama ơơi, palơq Ama dyóp tarnêêng maar nek ve chóóm. Nhan pei lơơi choom ađô tââq akóón. Bơơi eh rau nek rau akóón kiêng, hơq nek rau Ama kiêng.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Hayơq Ađó val lóóiq lơq lêi piđó dyơq bêch, hayơq Ađó payuur Phi-e-rơ: “Si-môôn, Amei bêch hơ? Amei kah đuôh meh lóóm mưi jơ chóóm alua? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Phaai meh lóóm lơq nhan gavơh, buôn adhi anó yươq mơk leq dharơơl galơơk. Lóóm karnóq nek lalua kiêng, bơơi achak araang vil druôi nhưh.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Mưi chu dyơq, xók ơi yuur vôôiq, Ađó nhan gavơh, móón nôôq paraaq markơi ahei. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Lơq machu dyơq, xók val lóóiq, Ađó lêi piđó xók bêch, ơi mat piđó haleng jarliq, lơq piđó kah n'nal rau đóng ââi paraaq Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Hayơq Ađó tơk machu đu pe lơq praaq palơq piđó: “Adhi anó dyơq bhiêk bêch lơq dhêi drơq hơ? Dyóp aq! Jơ ơi tơk. Phaai lêi aq! Akóón Manưih ravang bâân tamôôp pajaau leq têi manưih ve matu. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Phaai yuur dyương, hêq vôôiq. Lêi tôôh, manưih tamôôp aku ơi tơk đan.” <verse eid="MRK 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />N'drươh ađek, xók Ađó bhiêk dyơq papraaq, Ju-đa, mưi kalóóng majêt sưưq-đô, vôôiq tơk lơq nek palơq ađó nek mưi kabhuh ting kadhâng bhươt dhaau lơq tarlââng bhaniiq, yuur vôôiq tââq dham nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih, nôôq thêi pachóóm gani lơq nôôq takóh bhươl. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Xók achêk, manưih têêng tamôôp Ađó ơi đóng piđó mưi kanal, kơi ađô: “Ngaai n'đó hơq aku chum nek chênh nek ađó ađek. Phaai kóóp ađó ađek lơq đââng vôôiq kơi chagơn.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Kơi achêk nek, bhêêl ơi tơk dham, n'drươh, xong xók ruul tơk Chuôq, ađó móón: “Ra-bi,” hayơq ađó chum Chuôq. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Xók achêk, nôôq piđó kadhâng têi dhiq Ađó lơq kóóp kađaai Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Bơơi mưi chanak tôôh kalóóng nôôq manưih dyương đan, xong xók thuôt pagluh bhươt, ơi ruul m'preh dhơn ratơơq ưng takóh kadhâng bhanuôih lơq têch tatươt katór ađó ađek. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Ââi lóóiq tarnêêng kóóp kađaai, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Nôôq pe yuur vôôiq nek palơq bhươt kóóih lơq tarlââng bhaniiq buôn kóóp aku kơi ngóq tajơl lóóiq mưi manưih papei alua? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Dyóp tangêi aku tơơt palơq nôôq pe bhêêl truuih pachóóm kalóóng đong bhanuôih, hơq nôôq pe kah kóóp aku. Dhơ kơi ađek, ađôk nek buôn paraaq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng bâân tarjaap.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Xong xók lơơi lóóiq Ađó, tabhơt piđó maar mut klôôn.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Mưi n'dhóm tôôh vôôiq ting Chuôq, biêh chapiên xơp m'beq aau chaguôk bhaai lenh dhuum praang achak, lơq piđó kóóp kađaai ađó, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />bơơi xong xók m'peq lóóiq m'beq aau chaguôk, ađó ađek lalôh lalut mut xooq.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Nôôq piđó đââng Chuôq Jê-su tơk dhiq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm, lơq tabhơt nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih, nôôq takóh bhươl, palơq nôôq thêi pachóóm gani maar karong gaboq lóóiq. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Hayơq Phi-e-rơ ting Ađó tââq đu changaai, mót tơk dhiq hót kalóóng taang ưng takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm, hayơq ađó tơơt palơq nôôq linh đương jư lơq haang pangan tóór par-aang óih. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Xók achêk, nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih lơq pabhơt Kabhuh xêi xanêi Jo Thaaiq xók tabâân pakah lơt pâng jaklâk lóóiq Chuôq Jê-su buôn đââng Ađó mót dham chêt, hơq piđó kah rau bâân lêi. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Ơi bơk ngaai truuih đuui chachââr jaklâk lóóiq Ađó, hơq paraaq truuih ưng piđó nek kah markơi xóng piđó. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Bơơr pe chanak, xong xók yuur dyương, truuih đuui chachââr jaklâk lóóiq Ađó, xók praaq <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />kơi ađô: “Nôôq yi xâng ađó ađek praaq nek ‘Aku e rơh pahư đong bhanuôih tââq têi manưih yuur têêng ađô, hayơq kalóóng pe tangêi aku e têêng mưi đong bhanuôih lââng eh tââq têi manưih chóóm têêng.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Dhơ kơi achêk, chênh tabhơt leq tarnêêng ađô, nek paraaq truuih ưng piđó kung kah markơi. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Hayơq xong xók yuur dyương dhiq m'pơng dyóp ngaai, takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm tamóh Chuôq Jê-su kơi ađô: “Hau amei kah ââi marau marâ? Nôôq manưih ađô truuih đuui jaklâk lóóiq amei hau rau?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Bơơi Ađó bhiêk parngau lơq kah ââi marau marâ. Takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm lóóiq tamóh Ađó, lơq ađó praaq palơq Chuôq: “Amei ve lua nek Chuôq Paq Manưih, Akóón ưng Yaang đaang bhi haanh, eh?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Xók achêk, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Chênh nek aku; hayơq nôôq pe e lêi Akóón Manưih tơơt hót tươm Yaang Mataai Karơ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:62">lơq bhral dhiq m'pơng nôôq garboq dhaluk pleng.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Kơi achêk hayơq xong xók heek tanteek aau ađêi, takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm praaq: “Nôôq he hau hayơq đươi leq manưih truuih đuui dyơq? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Nôôq pe ve xâng paraaq chôlô ơi. Nôôq pe ng'kơi kanóq?” Kơi achêk hayơq pabhơt maar yuur kaauq Chuôq nek manưih đaang chêt. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Masôôq manưih tââp gahaak kathui leq Ađó, kapit mat Ađó lơq m'bhiiq m'bhah Ađó, hayơq praaq palơq Ađó: “Praaq taruuih loom ngi lêi!” Nôôq linh đương jư kung pei chabit Ađó hơq m'pah.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Xók bhêêl Phi-e-rơ tơơt dhiq taang, mưi kalóóng nôôq dhơn ratơơq pađiil ưng takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm ruul tơk dham ađó. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Bhêêl lêi Phi-e-rơ haang óih pangan, xók lêi pagiit ađó, pađiil achêk móón: “Amei kung tơơt palơq Jê-su, manưih Na-xa-reet.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Bơơi ađó dyiin, móón kơi ađô: “Aku kah n'nal, kung kah n'nal amei papraaq hau rau.” Hayơq ađó vôôiq gluh leq taang. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Manưih ratơơq pađiil ơi ve lêi ađó vil tââp praaq palơq nôôq manưih xók dyương dhiq ađek kơi ađô: “Manưih ađô nek mađó kabhuh ađek!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Bơơi ađó dyiin machu dyơq. Maxưưiq tatun ađek, nôôq manưih dyương ađek vil praaq palơq Phi-e-rơ: “Dhakơi amei mađó leq kabhuh nôôq manưih ađek, ơi amei kung nek manưih Ga-li-lê.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Bơơi ađó tââp tóh lơq ng'kóh kơi ađô: “Aku kah n'nal manưih ađek, đu manưih hơq nôôq pe praaq tơk.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />N'drươh atưưch gôông takar chu đu bơơr lơq Phi-e-rơ yuur hei paraaq hơq Chuôq Jê-su ơi praaq palơq ađó kơi ađô: “Xók loom atưưch gôông takar bơơr guôp, amei e dyiin thêi pe chu,” hayơq xók bhêêl karuôq luônh lóóm, ađó bhrêq nhiim.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Nham mót vaar yayóng tarưưp, bhêêl nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih ơi tavaaih pahoop palơq nôôq takóh bhươl palơq nôôq thêi pachóóm gani palơq pabhơt Kabhuh xêi xanêi Jo Thaaiq, nek xong xók klooiq Chuôq Jê-su, piđó đââng Ađó vôôiq lơq pajaau đóng Phi-laat. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Phi-laat tamóh Ađó: “Amei nek Bhua dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq eh alua?” Bơơi xók ââi ađó, Chuôq móón: “Chênh amei praaq kơi achêk.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Hayơq nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih kaauq patu Ađó bơk rau. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Xók achêk, Phi-laat vil tamóh Ađó, kơi ađô: “Amei kah ââi lóóiq marau marâ hơ? Phaai lêi, piđó xók kaauq patu amei bơk n'nal đơq!” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su kah dyơq ââi lóóiq n'đó paraaq dyơq, tơk mơ Phi-laat lêi lóng chrih.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Mat lââng, mót dhalam bhiêk, ađó buôn đóók paloh đóng manưih dhanuôr mưi chanak tơơt đong kanam hơq piđó gavơh nhan. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Xók achêk, ve mưi chanak bâân đóók nek Ba-ra-ba xók bâân tơơt đong kanam nek palơq nôôq manưih têêng panhôôn, nek nôôq manưih têêng matu leng manưih kalóóng đu nhôôn nhaauq. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Xong xók maru tơk, kabhuh bơk tââp nhan kayua ađó kơi ađó buôn têêng đóng piđó. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Xók achêk, Phi-laat tamóh piđó, kơi ađô: “Nôôq pe kiêng aku paloh Bhua dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq đóng nôôq pe kah?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Ơi ađó ađek n'nal kơi nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih ơi đââng pajaau Ađó taai lóóm geet makhinh. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Bơơi nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih paxuq manưih dhanuôr buôn klóóih leq ađek, ađó ađek phaai paloh Ba-ra-ba đóng piđó. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xók tamóh lóóiq, Phi-laat praaq palơq piđó: “Kơi achêk nek, hau aku phaai têêng palơq manưih hơq nôôq pe đóók nek Bhua dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq ađôk?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Xók achêk, manưih dhanuôr vil lalơu karơ: “Phaai teeng đinh ađó dhiq n'lóóng m'baang chatông.” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Bơơi, Phi-laat praaq palơq piđó: “Taai hau rau đu aak manưih ađô ơi têêng?” Dhơ kơi ađek, palââng dhaang treeh karơ lơh: “Phaai teeng đinh ađó dhiq n'lóóng m'baang chatông.” <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Xók achêk, taai kiêng têêng iêm lóóm manưih ganơr, Phi-laat ơi paloh Ba-ra-ba đóng piđó lơq ađó đóng đââng Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq buôn xong xók m'bhiiq, nek Ađó bâân teeng đinh.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Bhêêl ađek, kabhuh linh garuiq Ađó mót kalóóng đong kuôn (chênh nek đong kuôn gamak) lơq dhaloong tabhơt kabhuh linh karong kaboq lóóiq, <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />hayơq piđó paguôk leq Ađó mưi beq aau parhóm bhrôông ngót, hayơq tapơơng đóng Ađó mưi beq panơơng palơq axông piđó ơi gavương, <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />lơq piđó tââp chap yayar Ađó: “Driêu gahơ Bhua dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Kơi achêk hayơq, piđó m'bhiiq leq akoq Ađó palơq tarlââng lơq gahaak kathui leq Ađó, lơq chakoh takól leq katiêk bhuôih haanh Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Bhêêl kabhuh piđó ơi ajóóch Ađó xong, piđó lôh m'peq tââq Ađó beq aau parhóm bhrôông ngót lơq paxơp aau ưng Ađó đóng leq Ađó, hayơq đââng Ađó vôôiq buôn piđó teeng đinh Ađó dhiq n'lóóng m'baang chatông. <verse eid="MRK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Piđó kóóp mưi nak vôôiq dhiq kalơng tôôh, achak nek Si-môôn, manưih Si-reen (ama ưng A-lek-xan-đơ lơq Ru-phu), tââq bhươl đơk, buôn ađó đuôl n'lóóng m'baang chatông ưng Chuôq.<verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Piđó đââng Ađó tơk Gô-gô-tha (mưi dhiq dham hơq ađó ve kiêng móón nek “Dham Paliing Akoq”). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Piđó đóng Ađó ơm buôh bâân kaluk palơq dyet thum, bơơi Ađó kah ơm. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Hayơq piđó teeng đinh Ađó lơq tablah xóng ađêi aau ưng Ađó palơq kơi thuôt padhơơch đóng ađêi, lêi ngaai bâân n'đó phơn. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Bhêêl ađôk nek jơ đu pe, piđó teeng đinh Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ađôk nek tala papaan xaraq matu ưng Ađó, ơi bâân xaraq: “Bhua Dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Piđó kung teeng đinh bơơr chanak tatông nek palơq Ađó, mưi nak tơơt hót atươm, hayơq manak tôôh tơơt hót ađaai Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />(Paraaq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng ơi bâân tarjaap, kơi ađô: “Ađó bâân xêi madhiq palơq nôôq manưih kah vaaih gani.”) <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Nôôq manưih val vôôiq praaq bharlưưk Ađó, tangơr akoq ađêi lơq praaq: “Ơ hơ! Đu panong pahư đong bhanuôih hayơq têêng lóóiq kalóóng pe tangêi, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />phaai tư paq ađêi palơq dhaluônh tââq n'lóóng m'baang chatông aq!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Kung kiêng markơi achêk, nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih palơq nôôq thêi pachóóm gani, markơi ting praaq ajóóch Ađó, piđó praaq: “Ađó paq chóóm bơk manưih lââng, bơơi ađó kah chóóm tư pei paq ađêi. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Chuôq Paq Manưih, Bhua ưng I-sơ-ra-êên, bhêêl ađôk phaai dhaluônh tââq n'lóóng m'baang chatông aq, buôn nôôq yi lêi hơq huuiq.” Nôôq manưih bâân tateeng đinh nek palơq Ađó kung praaq ajóóch Ađó.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Tơk jơ đu chapat, đu kanam kanheet yuur vaaih dhuum plok katiêk đóng tơk jơ đu takiêh. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Mót jơ đu takiêh, Chuôq Jê-su lalơu karơ dhariêng: “Ê-lô-i, Ê-lô-i, la-ma sa-bech-tha-ni?” paraaq achêk ve kiêng móón nek: “Yaang Pleng aku ơơi, Yaang Pleng aku ơơi, hau taai Amei chóóm lơơi aku?” <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Xók xâng kơi achêk, nôôq manưih dyương đan ađek praaq: “Lêi tôôh, ađó nek dhaloong Ê-li.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Kơi achêk hayơq, mưi nak ađek, xong xók yuur mut tươm bing đơơk kadyuôq leq tapô taxiiq, tabóq dhiq tóóng ale, ađó achêk đóng leq Ađó ơm, móón: “Phaai bhiêk lơơi mak kơi ađó, lêi Ê-li ve tơk đââng ađó dhaluônh kah.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Xók achêk, xong xók ơi yuur lalơu mưi dhariêng karơ, Chuôq Jê-su pat parhââm xariêq. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Lơq bhaai paryoong kalóóng đong bhanuôih bâân tanteek têêng bơơr tââq piing leq raal. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Bhêêl ađôk manưih kadhâng akoq linh, ađó dyương dhiq hót toom Chuôq, xók ơi lêi kơi Chuôq pat parhââm xariêq kơi achêk, ađó praaq: “Lalua, manưih ađôk nek Akóón ưng Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Kung ve nôôq manưih pađiil dyương lêi tââq changaai, kalóóng sôôq piđó ve Ma-ri Ma-đơ-leen, Ma-ri (amêêq Ja-kơ katưưiq lơq Jô-sê) nek palơq Sa-lô-mê, <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />nek nôôq manưih hơq xók Ađó dyơq tơơt dhiq Ga-li-lê, piđó ơi vôôiq ting Ađó lơq têêng yaauq Ađó, hayơq bơk pađiil lââng dyơq ơi ting vôôiq đơk palơq Ađó tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Bhêêl ơi tơk habu blót aq, taai tangêi ađek nek Tangêi Ravang Ravưa, hơq nek tangêi laloom tangêi Sa-baat, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Jô-seep, nek manưih tââq xưưq A-ri-ma-thê, mưi chanak đaang bhi kalóóng Kabhuh Xêi Xanêi, kung chênh nek manưih xók đương rââm katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng, xók ơi tơk dham, ađó grâ lóóm mót lum Phi-laat lơq tamóh nhan xaak Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Xók achêk, Phi-laat lóng chrih xâng la alua nek Ađó ơi chêt aq, lơq xong xók dhaloong manưih kadhâng akoq linh, ađó tamóh manưih achêk lêi kơi Chuôq ơi chêt mơ đươnh. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Bhêêl ơi n'nal giit rau tarnêêng tââq manưih kadhâng akoq linh, ađó ađek pajaau xaak đóng Jô-seep. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Xong xók kơl bhaai lenh, đââng Ađó padhaluônh tââq n'lóóng m'baang chatông, ađó pươr Chuôq lóóiq palơq bhaai achêk, lơq tabêch Chuôq leq mưi beq ping ơi bâân phaaq kalóóng bhangôh dhơl. Hayơq ađó talâh mưi bhangôh dhơl kađơp palóng ping. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Bhêêl achêk, Ma-ri Ma-đơ-leen lơq Ma-ri amêêq ưng Jô-sê ơi ting lêi dham Ađó bâân tơp buur.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Xók tangêi Sa-baat ơi lơh, Ma-ri Ma-đơ-leen, Ma-ri amêêq Ja-kơ, lơq Sa-lô-mê, kơl janươu thum buôn xók tơk dham, piđó ve chóóm xut xaak Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Tââq lóng tarưưp tangêi đu mưi kalóóng tun, piđó vôôiq tơk dham đong ping xók mat tangêi tââp blo. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Piđó tapraaq xóng piđó: “Ngaai e talâh bhangôh dhơl tââq palóng đong ping đóng nôôq he?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Xók riing lêi, piđó lêi kơi bhangôh dhơl ơi bâân talâh patââi, dhơ ađó lóng gamak. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Hayơq xók ơi mót kalóóng đong ping, piđó lêi mưi n'dhóm xơp aau bhóók xók tơơt dhiq hót atươm, lơq piđó bâân kakhin lêi. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Bơơi manưih achêk praaq palơq piđó: “Óóq kakhin. Nôôq pe xók chêk-lêi Jê-su manưih Na-xa-reet, Yaang ơi bâân tateeng dhiq n'lóóng m'baang chatông. Ađó ơi bâân têêng mamông lóóiq aq! Ađó kah tơơt dhiq đôk. Phaai lêi dham đu palââng ơi tabêch xaak Ađó. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Dhơ kơi achêk, Phaai vôôiq, praaq đóng nôôq môôn-đô Ađó lơq Phi-e-rơ kơi ađô: ‘Ađó e vôôiq loom adhi anó tơk Ga-li-lê. Dhiq ađek, adhi anó e lêi Ađó’, dhalam kơi Ađó ơi praaq palơq adhi anó.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Bhêêl ơi gluh leq nguôi, piđó mut tââq đong ping, ơi rau hayer papreh lơq hêq lêi klum dhuum piđó. Lơq piđó kah rau praaq palơq ngaai ơi taai piđó kakhin kapơn bhlơng. <verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />(Yayóng tarưưp tangêi đu mưi kalóng tun, xók ơi mamông lóóiq, Ađó pakah tabhral laloom tââm đóng Ma-ri Ma-đơ-leen, nek manưih hơq Ađó ơi viêng tapól panong abhưi gluh xooq. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Manưih pađiil achêk vôôiq truuih lóóiq đóng nôôq manưih glêh tơơt palơq Ađó xók bhêêl piđó xók ayô châq lơq nhiim kalau. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Hayơq piđó, xók xâng kơi Ađó dyơq mamông lơq ơi bâân chênh pađiil ve lêi, nek kah huuiq.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Xók achêk, tatun nôôq tarnêêng achêk, Ađó pakah tabhral kalóóng dyaang achak lââng đóng bơơr chanak kalóóng sôôq piđó xók bhêêl vôôiq dyung yuur chô leq xưưq xaang. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Lơq bơơr nhiđó achêk, xong xók val chô, truuih đóng nôôq môôn-đô đu dyơq, bơơi piđó kah huuiq bơơr nhiđó.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Bơơi hayơq, tatun xariêq, Ađó pakah tabhral đóng majêt sưưq-đô xók bhêêl piđó tơơt tóór baang chacha, Ađó trêh teng rau kah huuiq lơq nhâng lóóm ưng piđó taai piđó kah huuiq nôôq manưih ơi lêi Ađó xong xók Ađó ơi bâân mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Ađó praaq kayua piđó: “Phaai vôôiq tơk plok hóng katiêk, phaai truuih pachóóm Taruuih Liêm đóng dyóp ngaai. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Ngaai huuiq lơq đơơp bap-teem e bâân paq, hayơq ngaai kah huuiq e bâân xêi matu. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Nôôq kanal chrih ađôk e ting vôôiq palơq nôôq manưih ve lóóm huuiq: Vơn dhanóók thêi, piđó e viêng pagluh nôôq abhưi. Piđó e praaq nôôq rau dhariêng tame. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Piđó e kóóp kaxênh, lơq dhơ đóng piđó ơm hau rau bhanuôh, dhakơi ađó yươq têêng mahaai rau tơk piđó. Piđó e lơơi têi dhiq nôôq manưih dhuôr ka-ai nek nôôq manưih achêk e bâân yươh.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Xong xók Chuôq Jê-su ơi praaq palơq piđó, Ađó bâân padyók leq pleng lơq tơơt hót tươm Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Hayơq nôôq manưih ađek, xong xók yuur vôôiq, piđó truuih pachóóm plok dyóp leq, bhêêl xók Chuôq têêng tarnêêng palơq piđó lơq đu lêi đóng taruuih palơq nôôq kanal chrih ting vaaih. A-meen.)<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>